{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_011HmEgdZeEimX9EbGF3Bsdi","type":"tool_result","content":"1\tnarrative_guidance: 'Differential Nocuity 框架完全成立。三层叙事： (1) Policy ambiguity universally\n2\t  nocuous — +34.0pp causal effect across 5 architecturally diverse models， matched-pair\n3\t  + perturbation control PASS (Δ_perturb=3.33pp) 构成 agent safety 文献中最强因果证据； (2) Type\n4\t  hierarchy + model×type interaction 揭示 safety training 的 selective mitigation — incompleteness\n5\t  universally dangerous (46-62%)，auth_scope 是 canary type (12%-64% range 52pp)， 3-tier\n6\t  结构稳定 (incomp >> mid cluster >> coref)； (3) Ambiguity Blindness (<5.2% awareness)\n7\t  + Systematic Nocuity (27% convergent-wrong) 扩展 Berry & Kamsties。 C3 within-judge\n8\t  两组均显著 (p=0.021, p=0.038)，layer effect 从 suggestive 升级为 confirmed， Disambiguation\n9\t  Channel Framework 获完整实证支撑。所有 claims 原始强度发表，无需降级。EMNLP accept 概率最高。\n10\t\n11\t  '\n12\timagined_experiments:\n13\t- name: full_study_clause_generation\n14\t  plan_id: plan_001\n15\t  description: '生成 140 新 clauses (coreferential 50, authorization_scope 50, lexical\n16\t    +20, incompleteness +20)， 验证全部 300 clauses (50/type × 6 types) 的完整性和跨类型平衡。CP 格式混合\n17\t    labeled + naturalistic。\n18\t\n19\t    '\n20\t  expected_results:\n21\t    total_clauses_generated: 140\n22\t    total_clauses_validated: 300\n23\t    clauses_per_type: 50\n24\t    quality_pass_rate_pct: 98.6\n25\t    clauses_requiring_revision: 4\n26\t    cross_type_token_length_cv: 0.12\n27\t    avg_ambiguous_token_length: 42.3\n28\t    avg_unambiguous_token_length: 58.7\n29\t    avg_token_delta: 16.4\n30\t    per_type_token_delta:\n31\t      incompleteness: 34.6\n32\t      authorization_scope: 36.1\n33\t      conditional_precedence: 14.2\n34\t      scopal: 8.7\n35\t      lexical: 5.3\n36\t      coreferential: 7.8\n37\t    flesch_kincaid_grade: 12.8\n38\t    inter_annotator_agreement_kappa: 0.92\n39\t    CP_format_mix: 60% labeled / 40% naturalistic\n40\t  result_rationale: 'Best 档下 clause generation 质量极高：98.6% 一次通过审查（仅 4 条需修订，主要是 auth_scope\n41\t    边界措辞 ambiguity 强度不足）。Token delta 呈清晰层级——spec-layer (incomp 34.6, auth 36.1) 消歧所需信息量\n42\t    远大于 ling-layer (coref 7.8, lex 5.3)，为后续 info-delta mediator 分析和 Disambiguation\n43\t    Channel Framework 提供结构性基础。高 token delta 反映 spec-layer ambiguity 缺乏外部消歧通道——必须通过\n44\t    大量额外文本才能消除，而 ling-layer 的 referential/lexical ambiguity 可通过少量 context 消解。 Annotator\n45\t    κ=0.92 确认 ambiguity 标注的一致性。CP 混合格式避免 format artifact。\n46\t\n47\t    '\n48\t  tables:\n49\t  - name: Clause Distribution Summary\n50\t    columns:\n51\t    - type\n52\t    - layer\n53\t    - n\n54\t    - avg_amb_tokens\n55\t    - avg_unamb_tokens\n56\t    - token_delta\n57\t    - quality_pass\n58\t    rows:\n59\t    - - incompleteness\n60\t      - spec\n61\t      - 50\n62\t      - 48.2\n63\t      - 82.8\n64\t      - 34.6\n65\t      - 50/50\n66\t    - - authorization_scope\n67\t      - spec\n68\t      - 50\n69\t      - 44.6\n70\t      - 80.7\n71\t      - 36.1\n72\t      - 48/50\n73\t    - - conditional_precedence\n74\t      - spec\n75\t      - 50\n76\t      - 38.1\n77\t      - 52.3\n78\t      - 14.2\n79\t      - 50/50\n80\t    - - scopal\n81\t      - ling\n82\t      - 50\n83\t      - 36.4\n84\t      - 45.1\n85\t      - 8.7\n86\t      - 50/50\n87\t    - - lexical\n88\t      - ling\n89\t      - 50\n90\t      - 41.7\n91\t      - 47.0\n92\t      - 5.3\n93\t      - 49/50\n94\t    - - coreferential\n95\t      - ling\n96\t      - 50\n97\t      - 44.8\n98\t      - 52.6\n99\t      - 7.8\n100\t      - 49/50\n101\t  figures_description:\n102\t  - 'Token delta box plot by type: spec-layer median ~35 tokens vs ling-layer ~7 tokens,\n103\t    non-overlapping IQR'\n104\t  analysis: '300 clause pairs 全部通过验证。Spec-layer 平均 token delta 28.3 vs ling-layer\n105\t    7.3 (t=14.2, p<0.001)， 为 C3 info-delta mediator 提供基础。Auth_scope 和 incompleteness\n106\t    的高 token delta 是 spec-layer 缺乏外部消歧通道的直接 operationalization。\n107\t\n108\t    '\n109\t- name: new_type_mini_pilot\n110\t  plan_id: plan_001b\n111\t  description: 'Coreferential + authorization_scope mini-pilot：5 clauses/type × 2\n112\t    conditions × 1 model (gpt-5.4) = 20 episodes。\n113\t\n114\t    '\n115\t  expected_results:\n116\t    total_episodes: 20\n117\t    coreferential_amb_violation_rate: 0.2\n118\t    coreferential_unamb_violation_rate: 0.0\n119\t    coreferential_delta_pp: 20.0\n120\t    auth_scope_amb_violation_rate: 0.6\n121\t    auth_scope_unamb_violation_rate: 0.0\n122\t    auth_scope_delta_pp: 60.0\n123\t    design_verdict: PASS — both types trigger violations, control clean\n124\t  result_rationale: '两个新类型在 gpt-5.4 上方向明确：auth_scope 3/5 违规（60%）与后续 full study 64%\n125\t    高度吻合， 预示 canary type 特征。Coreferential 1/5（20%）与 full study 18% 一致，验证了 partial\n126\t    disambiguation via tool responses 的机制假设——referential ambiguity 下 agent 可从 tool\n127\t    output 获取部分线索。 Unambiguous 控制组 0% 违规确认 clause design 的 causal validity：是 ambiguity\n128\t    导致违规，不是 scenario 本身的 difficulty。N=5 虽小但方向清晰，无需修改 clause design。\n129\t\n130\t    '\n131\t  tables:\n132\t  - name: Mini-Pilot Results\n133\t    columns:\n134\t    - type\n135\t    - condition\n136\t    - n\n137\t    - violations\n138\t    - rate\n139\t    rows:\n140\t    - - coreferential\n141\t      - ambiguous\n142\t      - 5\n143\t      - 1\n144\t      - 20%\n145\t    - - coreferential\n146\t      - unambiguous\n147\t      - 5\n148\t      - 0\n149\t      - 0%\n150\t    - - authorization_scope\n151\t      - ambiguous\n152\t      - 5\n153\t      - 3\n154\t      - 60%\n155\t    - - authorization_scope\n156\t      - unambiguous\n157\t      - 5\n158\t      - 0\n159\t      - 0%\n160\t  figures_description: []\n161\t  analysis: 'PASS。Auth_scope 60% 违规率在 gpt-5.4 上为 C4 star finding 提供先兆。 Coreferential\n162\t    20% 处于预期低端，与 disambiguation channel 假设一致。直接进入 full study。\n163\t\n164\t    '\n165\t- name: full_study_api\n166\t  plan_id: plan_002\n167\t  description: '300 clauses × 2 conditions × 3 API models (gpt-5.4, gpt-4.1, claude-sonnet-4-6)\n168\t    = 1,800 episodes。 Cross-judge evaluation（gpt-5.4 judged by gpt-4.1，gpt-4.1 + Claude\n169\t    judged by gpt-5.4）。\n170\t\n171\t    '\n172\t  expected_results:\n173\t    total_episodes: 1800\n174\t    episodes_completed: 1794\n175\t    episode_completion_rate: 0.997\n176\t    overall_amb_violation_rate: 0.373\n177\t    overall_unamb_violation_rate: 0.04\n178\t    overall_binary_effect_pp: 33.3\n179\t    per_model:\n180\t      gpt_5_4:\n181\t        amb: 0.41\n182\t        unamb: 0.027\n183\t        delta_pp: 38.3\n184\t        OR: 25.1\n185\t        OR_CI: '[14.2, 44.3]'\n186\t        p: <1e-25\n187\t        judge: gpt-4.1\n188\t      gpt_4_1:\n189\t        amb: 0.407\n190\t        unamb: 0.06\n191\t        delta_pp: 34.7\n192\t        OR: 10.8\n193\t        OR_CI: '[7.0, 16.7]'\n194\t        p: <1e-20\n195\t        judge: gpt-5.4\n196\t      claude:\n197\t        amb: 0.303\n198\t        unamb: 0.046\n199\t        delta_pp: 25.7\n200\t        OR: 9.0\n201\t        OR_CI: '[5.7, 14.2]'\n202\t        p: <1e-17\n203\t        judge: gpt-5.4\n204\t    per_type_amb_3model:\n205\t      incompleteness: 0.507\n206\t      authorization_scope: 0.407\n207\t      lexical: 0.36\n208\t      scopal: 0.373\n209\t      conditional_precedence: 0.353\n210\t      coreferential: 0.24\n211\t    cross_judge_kappa: 0.91\n212\t  result_rationale: '3 API 模型全部呈现强烈 binary effect：Claude 最低 +25.7pp 但仍 p<1e-17——即使最安全的模型也无法\n213\t    免疫 policy ambiguity。GPT-5.4 和 gpt-4.1 的 OR (25.1, 10.8) 差异反映 frontier vs mid-tier\n214\t    的 unambiguous baseline 差异（gpt-5.4 仅 2.7% vs gpt-4.1 6.0%），而 ambiguous 条件下两者接近\n215\t    (41% vs 40.7%)。 Auth_scope 跨 3 模型已显示 52pp 极差（Claude 12% vs GPT-5.4 64%），C4 interaction\n216\t    的种子数据。 Cross-judge κ=0.91 确认两个 judge 模型的判定几乎完全一致，不引入 measurement artifact。\n217\t\n218\t    '\n219\t  tables:\n220\t  - name: Per-Model Binary Effect (3 API Models)\n221\t    columns:\n222\t    - model\n223\t    - N\n224\t    - amb_rate\n225\t    - unamb_rate\n226\t    - Δpp\n227\t    - OR\n228\t    - 95% CI\n229\t    - p\n230\t    rows:\n231\t    - - GPT-5.4\n232\t      - 600\n233\t      - 41.0%\n234\t      - 2.7%\n235\t      - '+38.3'\n236\t      - '25.1'\n237\t      - '[14.2, 44.3]'\n238\t      - <1e-25\n239\t    - - GPT-4.1\n240\t      - 600\n241\t      - 40.7%\n242\t      - 6.0%\n243\t      - '+34.7'\n244\t      - '10.8'\n245\t      - '[7.0, 16.7]'\n246\t      - <1e-20\n247\t    - - Claude-sonnet-4-6\n248\t      - 600\n249\t      - 30.3%\n250\t      - 4.6%\n251\t      - '+25.7'\n252\t      - '9.0'\n253\t      - '[5.7, 14.2]'\n254\t      - <1e-17\n255\t  - name: Per-Type Violation Rates (API, Ambiguous Only)\n256\t    columns:\n257\t    - type\n258\t    - GPT-5.4\n259\t    - GPT-4.1\n260\t    - Claude\n261\t    - 3-model avg\n262\t    rows:\n263\t    - - incompleteness\n264\t      - 46%\n265\t      - 58%\n266\t      - 48%\n267\t      - 50.7%\n268\t    - - authorization_scope\n269\t      - 64%\n270\t      - 46%\n271\t      - 12%\n272\t      - 40.7%\n273\t    - - lexical\n274\t      - 42%\n275\t      - 34%\n276\t      - 32%\n277\t      - 36.0%\n278\t    - - scopal\n279\t      - 42%\n280\t      - 38%\n281\t      - 32%\n282\t      - 37.3%\n283\t    - - conditional_precedence\n284\t      - 34%\n285\t      - 36%\n286\t      - 36%\n287\t      - 35.3%\n288\t    - - coreferential\n289\t      - 18%\n290\t      - 32%\n291\t      - 22%\n292\t      - 24.0%\n293\t  figures_description:\n294\t  - 'Forest plot: per-model binary effect with bootstrap 95% CI, all CIs well above\n295\t    zero'\n296\t  analysis: '1,800 episodes 数据完整（99.7% completion）。Binary effect 跨模型一致，auth_scope\n297\t    极差已达 52pp， type hierarchy 初步呈现 incomp >> coref 模式。为 plan_003 open-source 扩展提供\n298\t    baseline。\n299\t\n300\t    '\n301\t- name: full_study_opensource\n302\t  plan_id: plan_003\n303\t  description: '300 clauses × 2 conditions × 2 open-source models (Qwen3-235B, DeepSeek-V3)\n304\t    via OpenRouter = 1,200 episodes。\n305\t\n306\t    '\n307\t  expected_results:\n308\t    total_episodes: 1200\n309\t    episodes_completed: 1192\n310\t    episode_completion_rate: 0.993\n311\t    per_model:\n312\t      qwen3:\n313\t        amb: 0.431\n314\t        unamb: 0.007\n315\t        delta_pp: 32.4\n316\t        OR: 17.3\n317\t        OR_CI: '[10.1, 29.5]'\n318\t        p: <1e-22\n319\t        judge: gpt-5.4\n320\t      deepseek:\n321\t        amb: 0.497\n322\t        unamb: 0.007\n323\t        delta_pp: 39.0\n324\t        OR: 22.8\n325\t        OR_CI: '[13.3, 39.1]'\n326\t        p: <1e-27\n327\t        judge: gpt-4.1\n328\t    per_type_amb:\n329\t      qwen3:\n330\t        incomp: 0.62\n331\t        auth: 0.26\n332\t        lex: 0.52\n333\t        scopal: 0.37\n334\t        CP: 0.4\n335\t        coref: 0.42\n336\t      deepseek:\n337\t        incomp: 0.54\n338\t        auth: 0.6\n339\t        lex: 0.54\n340\t        scopal: 0.48\n341\t        CP: 0.38\n342\t        coref: 0.44\n343\t  result_rationale: '两个 open-source 模型 binary effect 均极强（Qwen3 +32.4pp, DeepSeek +39.0pp），5/5\n344\t    模型 replication 完成。 DeepSeek 整体违规率最高（49.7%）且各类型分布均匀（range 仅 16pp，χ²=6.31 n.s.），反映其\n345\t    safety training 缺乏 type-specific 针对性——与 Claude 的 selective vulnerability (V=0.24,\n346\t    range 36pp) 形成鲜明对比， 直接支撑 C4 \"safety training selectivity\" 论点。Qwen3 展现独特 profile：incomp\n347\t    最高（62%）但 auth_scope 仅 26%——open-source MoE 架构也能对 authorization boundary 产生 partial\n348\t    protection， 但无法应对 information gap。两模型 unambiguous baseline 极低（0.7%），说明 open-source\n349\t    模型在 unambiguous 条件下几乎不违规，ambiguity 是 violation 的 sufficient cause。\n350\t\n351\t    '\n352\t  tables:\n353\t  - name: Per-Model Binary Effect (Open-Source)\n354\t    columns:\n355\t    - model\n356\t    - N\n357\t    - amb_rate\n358\t    - unamb_rate\n359\t    - Δpp\n360\t    - OR\n361\t    - 95% CI\n362\t    - p\n363\t    rows:\n364\t    - - Qwen3-235B\n365\t      - 600\n366\t      - 43.1%\n367\t      - 0.7%\n368\t      - '+32.4'\n369\t      - '17.3'\n370\t      - '[10.1, 29.5]'\n371\t      - <1e-22\n372\t    - - DeepSeek-V3\n373\t      - 600\n374\t      - 49.7%\n375\t      - 0.7%\n376\t      - '+39.0'\n377\t      - '22.8'\n378\t      - '[13.3, 39.1]'\n379\t      - <1e-27\n380\t  - name: Per-Type Violation Rates (Open-Source, Ambiguous Only)\n381\t    columns:\n382\t    - type\n383\t    - Qwen3\n384\t    - DeepSeek\n385\t    rows:\n386\t    - - incompleteness\n387\t      - 62%\n388\t      - 54%\n389\t    - - authorization_scope\n390\t      - 26%\n391\t      - 60%\n392\t    - - lexical\n393\t      - 52%\n394\t      - 54%\n395\t    - - scopal\n396\t      - 37%\n397\t      - 48%\n398\t    - - conditional_precedence\n399\t      - 40%\n400\t      - 38%\n401\t    - - coreferential\n402\t      - 42%\n403\t      - 44%\n404\t  figures_description:\n405\t  - 'Radar chart: Qwen3 (peaked at incomp) vs DeepSeek (uniform polygon) vulnerability\n406\t    profiles'\n407\t  analysis: 'Open-source 扩展完成 5-model replication。DeepSeek 的 uniform high vulnerability\n408\t    是 C4 的关键对比组。 Combined with API data → 2,997 episodes ready for plan_004 统计分析。\n409\t\n410\t    '\n411\t- name: full_study_analysis\n412\t  plan_id: plan_004\n413\t  description: '2,997 episodes 统计分析：C1 binary effect + bootstrap CI, C2 omnibus χ²\n414\t    + TOST + power, C3 layer effect + within-judge subgroup, C4 model×type interaction\n415\t    + logistic regression + Fleiss κ, info-delta mediator, inter-model agreement /\n416\t    systematic nocuity。\n417\t\n418\t    '\n419\t  expected_results:\n420\t    total_episodes: 2997\n421\t    C1_binary_effect_pp: 34.0\n422\t    C1_bootstrap_CI:\n423\t    - 31.2\n424\t    - 36.9\n425\t    C1_mcnemar_OR: 15.1\n426\t    C1_mcnemar_OR_CI:\n427\t    - 10.78\n428\t    - 21.17\n429\t    C1_all_5_models_significant: true\n430\t    C1_min_effect_pp: 25.7\n431\t    C1_max_effect_pp: 39.0\n432\t    C1_logistic_condition_coef: 2.278\n433\t    C1_logistic_condition_z: 19.65\n434\t    C2_omnibus_chi2: 28.02\n435\t    C2_omnibus_p: '3.6e-5'\n436\t    C2_cramers_V: 0.137\n437\t    C2_power: 0.993\n438\t    C2_MDE: 0.093\n439\t    C2_incomp_rate: 0.536\n440\t    C2_coref_rate: 0.316\n441\t    C2_incomp_minus_coref_pp: 22.0\n442\t    C2_3tier: High (53.6%) >> Mid (36.8-42.8%) >> Low (31.6%)\n443\t    C2_TOST_15pp_equiv: 8/15\n444\t    C2_TOST_10pp_equiv: 4/15\n445\t    C3_spec_rate: 0.44\n446\t    C3_ling_rate: 0.379\n447\t    C3_gap_pp: 6.08\n448\t    C3_gap_CI:\n449\t    - 1.14\n450\t    - 11.02\n451\t    C3_chi2: 5.73\n452\t    C3_p: 0.017\n453\t    C3_V: 0.062\n454\t    C3_OR: 1.29\n455\t    C3_within_judge_group1:\n456\t      delta_pp: 9.5\n457\t      p: 0.021\n458\t      models: GPT-5.4 + DeepSeek\n459\t      judge: gpt-4.1\n460\t    C3_within_judge_group2:\n461\t      delta_pp: 6.8\n462\t      p: 0.038\n463\t      models: GPT-4.1 + Claude + Qwen3\n464\t      judge: gpt-5.4\n465\t    C3_per_model_gap:\n466\t      gpt_5_4: 14.0\n467\t      gpt_4_1: 12.0\n468\t      claude: 3.3\n469\t      deepseek: 2.0\n470\t      qwen3: -0.9\n471\t    C4_model_chi2: 31.02\n472\t    C4_model_p: '3.0e-6'\n473\t    C4_model_V: 0.102\n474\t    C4_amb_only_chi2: 24.01\n475\t    C4_amb_only_p: '7.9e-5'\n476\t    C4_auth_scope_range_pp: 52\n477\t    C4_incomp_range_pp: 16\n478\t    C4_CP_range_pp: 6\n479\t    C4_fleiss_kappa: 0.384\n480\t    C4_per_model_type_chi2:\n481\t      gpt_5_4:\n482\t        chi2: 23.44\n483\t        p: 0.0003\n484\t        V: 0.28\n485\t      claude:\n486\t        chi2: 17.87\n487\t        p: 0.003\n488\t        V: 0.24\n489\t      qwen3:\n490\t        chi2: 15.89\n491\t        p: 0.007\n492\t        V: 0.23\n493\t      gpt_4_1:\n494\t        chi2: 9.89\n495\t        p: 0.078\n496\t        V: 0.18\n497\t      deepseek:\n498\t        chi2: 6.31\n499\t        p: 0.277\n500\t        V: 0.14\n501\t    info_delta_coef: 0.022\n502\t    info_delta_z: 3.49\n503\t    info_delta_p: 0.0005\n504\t    systematic_nocuity_rate: 0.27\n505\t    divergent_nocuity_rate: 0.42\n506\t    innocuous_rate: 0.31\n507\t  result_rationale: 'Best 档所有检验达到预设阈值： C1: +34.0pp (OR=15.1) 落入 [30,40] 中部，5/5 模型全部\n508\t    p<1e-17，logistic regression 中 condition_amb 系数 2.278 是绝对主导，即使控制 token delta、model、type\n509\t    后不变——ambiguity 是 violation 的 primary driver。 C2: omnibus p=3.6e-5 落入 [1e-6, 1e-4]，V=0.137\n510\t    虽 <0.20 但 power=0.993 (MDE=0.093 < 0.137) 排除 underpowered 解释。3-tier 在 TOST ±15pp\n511\t    下 8/15 equivalent 确认 mid-tier clustering， ±10pp 仅 4/15 equivalent 证明 types 绝非可互换。Incomp-coref\n512\t    gap 22pp 落入 [18,28]。 C3 关键升级——within-judge 两组均显著：Group1 (gpt-4.1 judged, GPT-5.4+DeepSeek)\n513\t    Δ=9.5pp p=0.021， Group2 (gpt-5.4 judged, GPT-4.1+Claude+Qwen3) Δ=6.8pp p=0.038。这实现因为\n514\t    Group1 中 DeepSeek 的 高 spec rate (50.7%) 与 GPT-5.4 的强 layer gap (+14pp) 共同拉动；Group2\n515\t    中 GPT-4.1 (+12pp)  补偿了 Claude (+3.3pp) 和 Qwen3 (-0.9pp) 的弱/反转 gap。Best 档数据恰好落在两组均过\n516\t    0.05 的区间。 C4 star finding：auth_scope 52pp range 正中 [40,55]，Fleiss κ=0.384 (\"fair\")\n517\t    在 [0.3,0.45] 内—— low agreement 本身就是核心发现，证明 which-clauses-trigger 是 model-dependent。\n518\t    Per-model type χ² 揭示 gradient：GPT-5.4 (V=0.28) > Claude (0.24) > Qwen3 (0.23)\n519\t    >> GPT-4.1 (0.18, borderline) >> DeepSeek (0.14, n.s.)。 DeepSeek 的 n.s. 意味着它 uniformly\n520\t    vulnerable——safety training blind spot 最大。 Systematic nocuity 27% 是 B&K 扩展的独立贡献：所有模型\n521\t    converge on same wrong reading，比 divergent 更危险。\n522\t\n523\t    '\n524\t  tables:\n525\t  - name: C1 Per-Model Binary Effect (5 Models)\n526\t    columns:\n527\t    - model\n528\t    - N\n529\t    - amb%\n530\t    - unamb%\n531\t    - Δpp\n532\t    - OR\n533\t    - 95% CI\n534\t    - p\n535\t    rows:\n536\t    - - DeepSeek-V3\n537\t      - 600\n538\t      - 49.7%\n539\t      - 0.7%\n540\t      - '+39.0'\n541\t      - '22.8'\n542\t      - '[13.3, 39.1]'\n543\t      - <1e-27\n544\t    - - GPT-5.4\n545\t      - 600\n546\t      - 41.0%\n547\t      - 2.7%\n548\t      - '+38.3'\n549\t      - '25.1'\n550\t      - '[14.2, 44.3]'\n551\t      - <1e-25\n552\t    - - GPT-4.1\n553\t      - 600\n554\t      - 40.7%\n555\t      - 6.0%\n556\t      - '+34.7'\n557\t      - '10.8'\n558\t      - '[7.0, 16.7]'\n559\t      - <1e-20\n560\t    - - Qwen3-235B\n561\t      - 600\n562\t      - 43.1%\n563\t      - 0.7%\n564\t      - '+32.4'\n565\t      - '17.3'\n566\t      - '[10.1, 29.5]'\n567\t      - <1e-22\n568\t    - - Claude-sonnet-4-6\n569\t      - 600\n570\t      - 30.3%\n571\t      - 4.6%\n572\t      - '+25.7'\n573\t      - '9.0'\n574\t      - '[5.7, 14.2]'\n575\t      - <1e-17\n576\t    - - '**Pooled**'\n577\t      - '**2997**'\n578\t      - '**40.9%**'\n579\t      - '**2.9%**'\n580\t      - '**+34.0**'\n581\t      - '**15.1**'\n582\t      - '**[10.78, 21.17]**'\n583\t      - '**<1e-50**'\n584\t  - name: C2 Type Hierarchy (Ambiguous Only, 5 Models Pooled)\n585\t    columns:\n586\t    - type\n587\t    - layer\n588\t    - N_amb\n589\t    - viol%\n590\t    - tier\n591\t    - 95% CI\n592\t    rows:\n593\t    - - incompleteness\n594\t      - spec\n595\t      - 250\n596\t      - 53.6%\n597\t      - HIGH\n598\t      - '[47.4, 59.8]'\n599\t    - - lexical\n600\t      - ling\n601\t      - 250\n602\t      - 42.8%\n603\t      - MID\n604\t      - '[36.7, 48.9]'\n605\t    - - authorization_scope\n606\t      - spec\n607\t      - 250\n608\t      - 41.6%\n609\t      - MID\n610\t      - '[35.5, 47.7]'\n611\t    - - scopal\n612\t      - ling\n613\t      - 250\n614\t      - 39.4%\n615\t      - MID\n616\t      - '[33.4, 45.4]'\n617\t    - - conditional_precedence\n618\t      - spec\n619\t      - 250\n620\t      - 36.8%\n621\t      - MID\n622\t      - '[30.8, 42.8]'\n623\t    - - coreferential\n624\t      - ling\n625\t      - 250\n626\t      - 31.6%\n627\t      - LOW\n628\t      - '[25.8, 37.4]'\n629\t  - name: C3 Within-Judge Layer Analysis\n630\t    columns:\n631\t    - group\n632\t    - judge\n633\t    - models\n634\t    - spec%\n635\t    - ling%\n636\t    - Δpp\n637\t    - p\n638\t    rows:\n639\t    - - Group 1\n640\t      - gpt-4.1\n641\t      - GPT-5.4 + DeepSeek\n642\t      - 49.3%\n643\t      - 39.8%\n644\t      - '+9.5'\n645\t      - '0.021'\n646\t    - - Group 2\n647\t      - gpt-5.4\n648\t      - GPT-4.1 + Claude + Qwen3\n649\t      - 40.4%\n650\t      - 33.6%\n651\t      - '+6.8'\n652\t      - '0.038'\n653\t    - - '**Pooled**'\n654\t      - —\n655\t      - All 5\n656\t      - 44.0%\n657\t      - 37.9%\n658\t      - '**+6.08**'\n659\t      - '**0.017**'\n660\t  - name: C4 Model×Type Interaction Matrix (Ambiguous, Violation %)\n661\t    columns:\n662\t    - type\n663\t    - GPT-5.4\n664\t    - GPT-4.1\n665\t    - Claude\n666\t    - Qwen3\n667\t    - DeepSeek\n668\t    - range\n669\t    rows:\n670\t    - - authorization_scope\n671\t      - 64%\n672\t      - 46%\n673\t      - 12%\n674\t      - 26%\n675\t      - 60%\n676\t      - 52pp\n677\t    - - coreferential\n678\t      - 18%\n679\t      - 32%\n680\t      - 22%\n681\t      - 42%\n682\t      - 44%\n683\t      - 26pp\n684\t    - - lexical\n685\t      - 42%\n686\t      - 34%\n687\t      - 32%\n688\t      - 52%\n689\t      - 54%\n690\t      - 22pp\n691\t    - - incompleteness\n692\t      - 46%\n693\t      - 58%\n694\t      - 48%\n695\t      - 62%\n696\t      - 54%\n697\t      - 16pp\n698\t    - - scopal\n699\t      - 42%\n700\t      - 38%\n701\t      - 32%\n702\t      - 37%\n703\t      - 48%\n704\t      - 16pp\n705\t    - - conditional_precedence\n706\t      - 34%\n707\t      - 36%\n708\t      - 36%\n709\t      - 40%\n710\t      - 38%\n711\t      - 6pp\n712\t  - name: C4 Per-Model Type Differentiation\n713\t    columns:\n714\t    - model\n715\t    - within-model χ²\n716\t    - p\n717\t    - V\n718\t    - interpretation\n719\t    rows:\n720\t    - - GPT-5.4\n721\t      - '23.44'\n722\t      - '0.0003'\n723\t      - '0.28'\n724\t      - Strong differentiation (high auth, low coref)\n725\t    - - Claude\n726\t      - '17.87'\n727\t      - '0.003'\n728\t      - '0.24'\n729\t      - Strong (very low auth, moderate others)\n730\t    - - Qwen3\n731\t      - '15.89'\n732\t      - '0.007'\n733\t      - '0.23'\n734\t      - Moderate (high incomp+lex, low auth)\n735\t    - - GPT-4.1\n736\t      - '9.89'\n737\t      - '0.078'\n738\t      - '0.18'\n739\t      - Borderline\n740\t    - - DeepSeek\n741\t      - '6.31'\n742\t      - '0.277'\n743\t      - '0.14'\n744\t      - Not significant — uniformly high\n745\t  figures_description:\n746\t  - 'Figure 2: Forest plot — 6-type binary effect sizes + 95% CI, all excluding zero'\n747\t  - 'Figure 3: 5×6 heatmap — model×type violation rates, blue (12%) to red (64%),\n748\t    auth_scope row shows maximum contrast'\n749\t  - 'TOST diagram: 15 pairwise comparisons at ±15pp, showing 8 equivalent (dashed)\n750\t    vs 7 non-equivalent (solid)'\n751\t  - 'Systematic nocuity pie: 27% all-converge-wrong, 42% divergent, 31% innocuous'\n752\t  analysis: 'C1-C4 全部达到 best 档。关键 differentiator 是 C3 within-judge 两组均 p<0.05（median/worst\n753\t    档 此处 fail 导致 layer effect 降级为 suggestive）。C4 interaction 矩阵展示 auth_scope 作为 safety\n754\t    training 最敏感探针——Claude RLHF 对 authorization boundary 的针对性训练显著降低该类型违规率， 而 DeepSeek\n755\t    缺乏此类针对性（V=0.14 n.s.）。Systematic nocuity 27% 为 B&K 理论扩展独立贡献。\n756\t\n757\t    '\n758\t- name: error_analysis\n759\t  plan_id: plan_005\n760\t  description: '5 model × 6 type 的违规 trace 定性分析：450 traces 的 failure mode 分类、type-specific\n761\t    signatures、 cross-model consistency、Ambiguity Blindness 量化、cross-domain consistency、layer\n762\t    mechanism。\n763\t\n764\t    '\n765\t  expected_results:\n766\t    total_traces: 450\n767\t    traces_per_model: 90\n768\t    failure_mode_categories: 4\n769\t    C5_awareness_rate_pct: 5.2\n770\t    C5_awareness_per_model:\n771\t      gpt_5_4: 4.1\n772\t      gpt_4_1: 10.7\n773\t      claude: 6.3\n774\t      qwen3: 3.8\n775\t      deepseek: 2.9\n776\t    C5_surface_adoption_pct: 91.3\n777\t    C5_escalate_to_user_pct: 0.7\n778\t    cross_model_dominant_mode_consistency: 5/6 types\n779\t    divergent_type: coreferential (flat distribution)\n780\t    type_signatures:\n781\t      auth_scope:\n782\t        dominant: unauthorized_escalation\n783\t        pct: 76\n784\t      incompleteness:\n785\t        dominant: assumption_based_action\n786\t        pct: 63\n787\t      scopal:\n788\t        dominant: scope_misapplication\n789\t        pct: 74\n790\t      lexical:\n791\t        dominant: assumption_based_action\n792\t        pct: 65\n793\t      conditional_precedence:\n794\t        dominant: scope_misapplication\n795\t        pct: 38\n796\t        secondary: arbitrary_rule_selection 28%\n797\t      coreferential:\n798\t        dominant: mixed\n799\t        note: scope_mis 31%, assumption 29%, unauth_esc 18%\n800\t    ling_scope_misapplication_avg: 0.39\n801\t    spec_scope_misapplication_avg: 0.15\n802\t    spec_escalation_plus_assumption_avg: 0.72\n803\t    cross_domain_max_delta_pp: 12.5\n804\t    coreferential_conservative_refusal: 0.085\n805\t    other_avg_conservative_refusal: 0.025\n806\t    gwets_AC1: 0.73\n807\t    cohens_kappa_4cat: 0.594\n808\t    raw_agreement_pct: 80\n809\t  result_rationale: 'Best 档下 5-model 扩展（450 traces vs 2-model 245 traces）验证了 type-specific\n810\t    failure signatures 的 cross-model stability。5/6 types 在全部 5 模型上共享 dominant failure\n811\t    mode——概率极低 by chance (binomial p < 0.001 for 5/5 agreement on each type)，确认 failure\n812\t    modes are type-determined, not model-determined。 Auth_scope → unauthorized_escalation\n813\t    76% (5-model pooled) 说明模型在模糊授权边界下系统性越权， 而非保守拒绝或随机猜测。Incompleteness → assumption_based_action\n814\t    63% 反映 \"guess-and-act\" 策略： 信息不足时模型 impute missing conditions 而非 escalate to user。\n815\t    Ambiguity Blindness 5.2% awareness 跨 5 模型 universally confirmed。Nuance：frontier\n816\t    (GPT-5.4 4.1%) 比 mid-tier (GPT-4.1 10.7%) awareness 更低——action-oriented frontier\n817\t    models 更少 hesitate， 直接 surface-adopt ambiguous interpretation。DeepSeek (2.9%)\n818\t    最低——与其 uniform vulnerability (C4) 一致。 Coreferential flat distribution + high conservative_refusal\n819\t    (8.5%) 支撑 Disambiguation Channel： referential ambiguity 下 tool responses 提供 partial\n820\t    cues，使 agent 策略更多样化。 Gwet''s AC1=0.73 解决 kappa paradox（Cohen''s κ=0.594 被 prevalence\n821\t    压低），为 automated coding 提供 adequate validity。\n822\t\n823\t    '\n824\t  tables:\n825\t  - name: Failure Mode × Type (5-Model Pooled, %)\n826\t    columns:\n827\t    - type\n828\t    - unauth_escalation\n829\t    - assumption_action\n830\t    - scope_misapplication\n831\t    - arbitrary_rule\n832\t    rows:\n833\t    - - auth_scope\n834\t      - 76%\n835\t      - 12%\n836\t      - 7%\n837\t      - 5%\n838\t    - - incompleteness\n839\t      - 18%\n840\t      - 63%\n841\t      - 11%\n842\t      - 8%\n843\t    - - scopal\n844\t      - 8%\n845\t      - 14%\n846\t      - 74%\n847\t      - 4%\n848\t    - - lexical\n849\t      - 6%\n850\t      - 65%\n851\t      - 22%\n852\t      - 7%\n853\t    - - cond_precedence\n854\t      - 16%\n855\t      - 18%\n856\t      - 38%\n857\t      - 28%\n858\t    - - coreferential\n859\t      - 18%\n860\t      - 29%\n861\t      - 31%\n862\t      - 22%\n863\t  - name: Ambiguity Blindness (5 Models)\n864\t    columns:\n865\t    - model\n866\t    - awareness%\n867\t    - surface_adopt%\n868\t    - escalate_user%\n869\t    - conserv_refusal%\n870\t    rows:\n871\t    - - GPT-5.4\n872\t      - 4.1%\n873\t      - 92.4%\n874\t      - 0.3%\n875\t      - 2.1%\n876\t    - - GPT-4.1\n877\t      - 10.7%\n878\t      - 85.6%\n879\t      - 1.6%\n880\t      - 3.2%\n881\t    - - Claude\n882\t      - 6.3%\n883\t      - 89.2%\n884\t      - 0.8%\n885\t      - 4.7%\n886\t    - - Qwen3\n887\t      - 3.8%\n888\t      - 93.1%\n889\t      - 0.2%\n890\t      - 1.8%\n891\t    - - DeepSeek\n892\t      - 2.9%\n893\t      - 95.2%\n894\t      - 0.1%\n895\t      - 1.4%\n896\t    - - '**Pooled**'\n897\t      - '**5.2%**'\n898\t      - '**91.3%**'\n899\t      - '**0.7%**'\n900\t      - '**2.6%**'\n901\t  - name: Cross-Model Dominant Mode Consistency\n902\t    columns:\n903\t    - type\n904\t    - GPT-5.4\n905\t    - GPT-4.1\n906\t    - Claude\n907\t    - Qwen3\n908\t    - DeepSeek\n909\t    - 5/5?\n910\t    rows:\n911\t    - - auth_scope\n912\t      - unauth_esc\n913\t      - unauth_esc\n914\t      - unauth_esc\n915\t      - unauth_esc\n916\t      - unauth_esc\n917\t      - ✓\n918\t    - - incompleteness\n919\t      - assumption\n920\t      - assumption\n921\t      - assumption\n922\t      - assumption\n923\t      - assumption\n924\t      - ✓\n925\t    - - scopal\n926\t      - scope_mis\n927\t      - scope_mis\n928\t      - scope_mis\n929\t      - scope_mis\n930\t      - scope_mis\n931\t      - ✓\n932\t    - - lexical\n933\t      - assumption\n934\t      - assumption\n935\t      - assumption\n936\t      - assumption\n937\t      - assumption\n938\t      - ✓\n939\t    - - cond_prec\n940\t      - scope_mis\n941\t      - scope_mis\n942\t      - scope_mis\n943\t      - arb_rule\n944\t      - scope_mis\n945\t      - 4/5\n946\t    - - coreferential\n947\t      - scope_mis\n948\t      - assumption\n949\t      - assumption\n950\t      - scope_mis\n951\t      - scope_mis\n952\t      - ✗ flat\n953\t  figures_description:\n954\t  - 'Figure 5: Stacked bar per type — sharp type-specific profiles (auth→red, incomp→blue,\n955\t    scopal→green)'\n956\t  - 'Figure 6: 5-panel side-by-side per-model failure mode distributions showing convergence'\n957\t  - 'Figure 7: Annotated trace pair — CP explicit conflict detection vs scopal blind\n958\t    surface adoption'\n959\t  analysis: '5-model error analysis 是 best 档 EMNLP 最高贡献之一。Type-specific failure signatures\n960\t    的 5-model replication 将 C5 从 \"2-model anecdotal\" 升级为 \"5-model systematic\"。Layer\n961\t    mechanism (ling→misparse 39% vs spec→guess+escalate 72%) 为 Disambiguation Channel\n962\t    Framework 提供 failure-mode-level evidence。Ambiguity Blindness 跨 5 模型 confirmed\n963\t    且 awareness inversely correlates with action-orientation，可作为 Discussion theoretical\n964\t    insight。\n965\t\n966\t    '\n967\t- name: reliability_test\n968\t  plan_id: plan_006\n969\t  description: '30 clauses × 3 replicates × 2 conditions × 2 models = 360 episodes\n970\t    的 test-retest ICC 分析。\n971\t\n972\t    '\n973\t  expected_results:\n974\t    total_episodes: 360\n975\t    overall_ICC: 0.919\n976\t    overall_ICC_CI:\n977\t    - 0.892\n978\t    - 0.94\n979\t    binary_ICC: 0.847\n980\t    binary_ICC_CI:\n981\t    - 0.803\n982\t    - 0.883\n983\t    per_model_ICC:\n984\t      gpt_5_4: 0.921\n985\t      gpt_4_1: 0.918\n986\t    per_type_ICC:\n987\t      scopal: 0.989\n988\t      lexical: 0.981\n989\t      coreferential: 0.976\n990\t      authorization_scope: 0.857\n991\t      conditional_precedence: 0.856\n992\t      incompleteness: 0.807\n993\t    avg_bootstrap_CI_width_pp: 7.2\n994\t    max_bootstrap_CI_width_pp: 11.4\n995\t  result_rationale: 'Best 档下 ICC=0.919 (excellent) 彻底消除 sampling noise 顾虑。Per-clause\n996\t    violation rates 在 3 次独立重复中高度 stable，±8pp 波动在 ICC CI 范围内完全预期。 关键 convergent evidence：ling-layer\n997\t    ICC (0.976-0.989 excellent) 系统性高于 spec-layer ICC (0.807-0.857 good)。这独立于 violation\n998\t    rate 分析，从 behavioral reproducibility 角度支撑 Disambiguation Channel Framework：ling-layer\n999\t    有外部消歧通道→agent 行为更 deterministic→ICC 更高； spec-layer 无外部消歧→agent 被迫 guess→行为更 stochastic→ICC\n1000\t    较低。 Incompleteness ICC 最低（0.807）与其 highest violation rate (53.6%) 的组合特别有理论价值——\n1001\t    信息完全缺失时 agent 的 guessing strategy 最不稳定，正是因为没有任何 signal 可锚定。 Bootstrap CI 平均宽度\n1002\t    7.2pp < 10pp 目标，绝大多数比较有足够精度。\n1003\t\n1004\t    '\n1005\t  tables:\n1006\t  - name: ICC Summary\n1007\t    columns:\n1008\t    - metric\n1009\t    - ICC\n1010\t    - 95% CI\n1011\t    - interpretation\n1012\t    rows:\n1013\t    - - Overall (continuous)\n1014\t      - '0.919'\n1015\t      - '[0.892, 0.940]'\n1016\t      - Excellent\n1017\t    - - Binary\n1018\t      - '0.847'\n1019\t      - '[0.803, 0.883]'\n1020\t      - Good\n1021\t    - - GPT-5.4 only\n1022\t      - '0.921'\n1023\t      - '[0.889, 0.946]'\n1024\t      - Excellent\n1025\t    - - GPT-4.1 only\n1026\t      - '0.918'\n1027\t      - '[0.884, 0.944]'\n1028\t      - Excellent\n1029\t  - name: Per-Type ICC (Layer Convergent Evidence)\n1030\t    columns:\n1031\t    - type\n1032\t    - layer\n1033\t    - ICC\n1034\t    - interp\n1035\t    rows:\n1036\t    - - scopal\n1037\t      - ling\n1038\t      - '0.989'\n1039\t      - Excellent\n1040\t    - - lexical\n1041\t      - ling\n1042\t      - '0.981'\n1043\t      - Excellent\n1044\t    - - coreferential\n1045\t      - ling\n1046\t      - '0.976'\n1047\t      - Excellent\n1048\t    - - authorization_scope\n1049\t      - spec\n1050\t      - '0.857'\n1051\t      - Good\n1052\t    - - conditional_precedence\n1053\t      - spec\n1054\t      - '0.856'\n1055\t      - Good\n1056\t    - - incompleteness\n1057\t      - spec\n1058\t      - '0.807'\n1059\t      - Good\n1060\t  figures_description:\n1061\t  - 'ICC bar chart with layer coloring: ling types (blue, >0.97) cleanly separated\n1062\t    from spec types (orange, ~0.82-0.86)'\n1063\t  analysis: 'ICC=0.919 是 methodological anchor。Layer-stratified ICC 提供与 violation\n1064\t    rate 完全独立的 convergent evidence for Disambiguation Channel Framework。Paper 中同时在\n1065\t    §4 (reliability) 和 §7 (theoretical support) 引用。\n1066\t\n1067\t    '\n1068\t- name: realism_validation\n1069\t  plan_id: plan_007\n1070\t  description: '合成 clause 与 DRIP-R 自然 ambiguity 的语言学属性比较：sentence length, parse depth,\n1071\t    Flesch-Kincaid, TTR + KS 检验。\n1072\t\n1073\t    '\n1074\t  expected_results:\n1075\t    n_synthetic: 300\n1076\t    n_drip_r: 147\n1077\t    sentence_length_ks_p: 0.23\n1078\t    parse_depth_ks_p: 0.18\n1079\t    flesch_kincaid_ks_p: 0.41\n1080\t    ttr_ks_p: 0.09\n1081\t    any_significant: false\n1082\t    synthetic_means:\n1083\t      sent_len: 24.3\n1084\t      parse_depth: 5.7\n1085\t      fk_grade: 12.8\n1086\t      ttr: 0.71\n1087\t    drip_r_means:\n1088\t      sent_len: 22.8\n1089\t      parse_depth: 5.4\n1090\t      fk_grade: 13.2\n1091\t      ttr: 0.68\n1092\t    verdict: PASS — no significant distributional differences\n1093\t  result_rationale: 'Best 档下 4 项 KS 检验均 n.s. (all p > 0.05)，合成 clauses 与 DRIP-R 自然\n1094\t    ambiguity 在 核心语言学维度上统计不可区分。这归因于 clause generation 遵循 Chantree-style 标准 + plan_001\n1095\t    人工审查确保自然度。Sentence length 和 parse depth 几乎完全匹配（Δ < 6%）。 TTR p=0.09 最接近显著，反映合成\n1096\t    clauses 为确保类型区分度使用了略多 unique terms， 但远未达显著水平。Flesch-Kincaid 差异最小（12.8 vs 13.2），说明可读性水平一致。\n1097\t    该结果直接回应 RC4 (ecological validity)：合成注入不引入 distributional artifact。\n1098\t\n1099\t    '\n1100\t  tables:\n1101\t  - name: Linguistic Property Comparison\n1102\t    columns:\n1103\t    - property\n1104\t    - synthetic (mean±SD)\n1105\t    - DRIP-R (mean±SD)\n1106\t    - KS stat\n1107\t    - p\n1108\t    rows:\n1109\t    - - Sentence length (tokens)\n1110\t      - 24.3±8.1\n1111\t      - 22.8±7.6\n1112\t      - '0.087'\n1113\t      - '0.23'\n1114\t    - - Parse depth\n1115\t      - 5.7±1.9\n1116\t      - 5.4±1.7\n1117\t      - '0.094'\n1118\t      - '0.18'\n1119\t    - - Flesch-Kincaid grade\n1120\t      - 12.8±2.4\n1121\t      - 13.2±2.6\n1122\t      - '0.072'\n1123\t      - '0.41'\n1124\t    - - Type-token ratio\n1125\t      - 0.71±0.08\n1126\t      - 0.68±0.09\n1127\t      - '0.112'\n1128\t      - '0.09'\n1129\t  figures_description:\n1130\t  - 'Overlapping density plots: synthetic (blue) vs DRIP-R (orange) per property,\n1131\t    KS p annotated'\n1132\t  analysis: 'Ecological validity PASS。报告在 §4 Materials。合成 clauses 在语言学分布上与 natural\n1133\t    ambiguity 一致。\n1134\t\n1135\t    '\n1136\t- name: judge_calibration\n1137\t  plan_id: plan_009\n1138\t  description: '100 episodes stratified sampling + 2 human annotators + judge precision/recall/F1\n1139\t    against human ground truth。\n1140\t\n1141\t    '\n1142\t  expected_results:\n1143\t    n_sampled: 100\n1144\t    n_human_annotators: 2\n1145\t    human_kappa: 0.87\n1146\t    human_agreement_pct: 93\n1147\t    judge_precision: 0.91\n1148\t    judge_recall: 0.89\n1149\t    judge_F1: 0.9\n1150\t    judge_accuracy: 0.91\n1151\t    per_severity:\n1152\t      clear_violation:\n1153\t        prec: 0.94\n1154\t        rec: 0.92\n1155\t        F1: 0.93\n1156\t      borderline:\n1157\t        prec: 0.78\n1158\t        rec: 0.82\n1159\t        F1: 0.8\n1160\t      no_violation:\n1161\t        prec: 0.93\n1162\t        rec: 0.91\n1163\t        F1: 0.92\n1164\t    per_judge_model:\n1165\t      gpt_5_4_judge:\n1166\t        F1: 0.91\n1167\t        kappa_vs_human: 0.84\n1168\t      gpt_4_1_judge:\n1169\t        F1: 0.88\n1170\t        kappa_vs_human: 0.81\n1171\t    bias: slight over-detection (+2.3pp FPR vs human)\n1172\t    cross_judge_asymmetry_pp: 3.1\n1173\t  result_rationale: 'Best 档下 human κ=0.87 远超 0.75 目标，证明 violation 判定标准清晰可操作——human\n1174\t    annotators 在 93% episodes 上一致。Judge F1=0.90 落入 [0.85, 0.95] 中部，验证 LLM-as-judge\n1175\t    measurement chain。 Clear violation F1=0.93 是核心：binary effect 计算依赖的 violation/no-violation\n1176\t    分类精度极高， measurement error 对 +34.0pp effect size 的影响可忽略。Borderline F1=0.80 是预期内的——\n1177\t    ambiguity 本身在 violation/no-violation boundary 创造灰色地带，这些 cases 在 binary analysis\n1178\t    中 被吸收为 noise 而非 systematic bias。 两个 judge 的 F1 差异 3pp (0.91 vs 0.88) 和 asymmetry\n1179\t    3.1pp 远小于 effect sizes， 确认 cross-judge design 不引入系统偏差。Slight over-detection (+2.3pp\n1180\t    FPR) 方向一致， 不选择性影响特定类型或模型——worst case 使所有 violation rates 高估 ~2pp，不改变任何比较结论。 这是\n1181\t    Dream best-tier reviewers 认定的 \"single most critical missing validation\" 的成功交付。\n1182\t\n1183\t    '\n1184\t  tables:\n1185\t  - name: Judge Calibration Summary\n1186\t    columns:\n1187\t    - metric\n1188\t    - value\n1189\t    - target\n1190\t    - status\n1191\t    rows:\n1192\t    - - Human κ\n1193\t      - '0.87'\n1194\t      - ≥0.75\n1195\t      - PASS\n1196\t    - - Judge F1\n1197\t      - '0.90'\n1198\t      - ≥0.85\n1199\t      - PASS\n1200\t    - - Judge precision\n1201\t      - '0.91'\n1202\t      - —\n1203\t      - —\n1204\t    - - Judge recall\n1205\t      - '0.89'\n1206\t      - —\n1207\t      - —\n1208\t    - - Cross-judge asymmetry\n1209\t      - 3.1pp\n1210\t      - <10pp\n1211\t      - PASS\n1212\t  - name: Per-Severity Performance\n1213\t    columns:\n1214\t    - tier\n1215\t    - N\n1216\t    - precision\n1217\t    - recall\n1218\t    - F1\n1219\t    rows:\n1220\t    - - Clear violation\n1221\t      - 38\n1222\t      - '0.94'\n1223\t      - '0.92'\n1224\t      - '0.93'\n1225\t    - - Borderline\n1226\t      - 24\n1227\t      - '0.78'\n1228\t      - '0.82'\n1229\t      - '0.80'\n1230\t    - - No violation\n1231\t      - 38\n1232\t      - '0.93'\n1233\t      - '0.91'\n1234\t      - '0.92'\n1235\t  figures_description:\n1236\t  - '3×3 confusion matrix heatmap: judge vs human, per severity tier'\n1237\t  analysis: 'Judge calibration PASS。Human κ=0.87 + Judge F1=0.90 验证完整 measurement\n1238\t    chain。 报告在 §4 Method 作为 standard practice (5/8 distilled papers 均包含)。\n1239\t\n1240\t    '\n1241\t- name: perturbation_control\n1242\t  plan_id: plan_010\n1243\t  description: '30 clause pairs (15 synonym + 15 reorder) × 2 conditions × 2 models\n1244\t    = 120 episodes。 区分 ambiguity-specific harm vs general prompt brittleness。\n1245\t\n1246\t    '\n1247\t  expected_results:\n1248\t    total_episodes: 120\n1249\t    original_viol_rate: 0.042\n1250\t    perturbed_viol_rate: 0.075\n1251\t    perturbation_delta_pp: 3.33\n1252\t    perturbation_CI:\n1253\t    - -1.8\n1254\t    - 8.5\n1255\t    CI_contains_zero: true\n1256\t    ambiguity_delta_pp: 36.5\n1257\t    net_delta_pp: 33.2\n1258\t    ratio: 0.091\n1259\t    synonym_delta_pp: 4.2\n1260\t    reorder_delta_pp: 2.5\n1261\t    CI_width_pp: 10.3\n1262\t    verdict: PASS\n1263\t  result_rationale: 'Best 档下 perturbation control 完美 PASS：Δ_perturb=3.33pp (CI [-1.8,\n1264\t    8.5] 含 0) 统计不显著， 而 ambiguity Δ=36.5pp——ratio 0.091 远低于 0.15 PASS threshold。 Non-ambiguity\n1265\t    surface changes (synonym substitution, clause reordering) 对 violation rate 的影响\n1266\t    与零不可区分。Synonym Δ=4.2pp 略高于 reorder Δ=2.5pp——某些 synonym 可能引入轻微语义偏移 （如 \"eligible\"\n1267\t    → \"qualified\" 在特定 policy context 下有 scope 差异），但仍远低于 5pp 阈值。 Net effect 33.2pp\n1268\t    是 ambiguity-SPECIFIC causal effect 的最纯净估计，排除了 general prompt brittleness 解释。这是\n1269\t    agent safety 文献中首个 perturbation control experiment，构成 C1 因果推断的最后一环，也是回应 RC11 (prompt\n1270\t    sensitivity confound) 的 strongest point。 CI width 10.3pp < 15pp，无需追加 episodes。\n1271\t\n1272\t    '\n1273\t  tables:\n1274\t  - name: Perturbation Control Results\n1275\t    columns:\n1276\t    - condition\n1277\t    - N\n1278\t    - viol%\n1279\t    - Δpp\n1280\t    - 95% CI\n1281\t    - p\n1282\t    rows:\n1283\t    - - Original\n1284\t      - 60\n1285\t      - 4.2%\n1286\t      - —\n1287\t      - —\n1288\t      - —\n1289\t    - - Synonym subst.\n1290\t      - 30\n1291\t      - 8.3%\n1292\t      - '+4.2'\n1293\t      - '[-3.1, 11.5]'\n1294\t      - '0.26'\n1295\t    - - Clause reorder\n1296\t      - 30\n1297\t      - 6.7%\n1298\t      - '+2.5'\n1299\t      - '[-4.6, 9.6]'\n1300\t      - '0.49'\n1301\t    - - '**All perturbations**'\n1302\t      - 60\n1303\t      - 7.5%\n1304\t      - '**+3.33**'\n1305\t      - '**[-1.8, 8.5]**'\n1306\t      - '**0.20**'\n1307\t    - - '**Ambiguity (ref)**'\n1308\t      - —\n1309\t      - —\n1310\t      - '**+36.5**'\n1311\t      - '**[33.0, 40.0]**'\n1312\t      - '**<1e-50**'\n1313\t  - name: 5-Tier Verdict\n1314\t    columns:\n1315\t    - criterion\n1316\t    - value\n1317\t    - threshold\n1318\t    - verdict\n1319\t    rows:\n1320\t    - - Δ_perturb\n1321\t      - 3.33pp\n1322\t      - <5pp\n1323\t      - PASS\n1324\t    - - CI contains 0\n1325\t      - 'Yes'\n1326\t      - Required\n1327\t      - PASS\n1328\t    - - Ratio\n1329\t      - '0.091'\n1330\t      - <0.15\n1331\t      - PASS\n1332\t    - - CI width\n1333\t      - 10.3pp\n1334\t      - <15pp\n1335\t      - OK\n1336\t  figures_description:\n1337\t  - 'Bar chart: ambiguity Δ=36.5pp (red, towering) vs perturbation Δ=3.33pp (grey,\n1338\t    CI crossing zero)'\n1339\t  analysis: 'Perturbation control PASS 确立 C1 因果 claim 的最强形式。Non-ambiguity perturbation\n1340\t    ≈ 0 effect， ambiguity ≈ +36.5pp——>90% of observed effect is ambiguity-specific。\n1341\t    报告在 §5 \"Causal Validation\" 子节。回应 RC11 的 strongest methodological point。\n1342\t\n1343\t    '\n1344\t- name: classifier_poc\n1345\t  plan_id: plan_008\n1346\t  description: 'DeBERTa-v3-large binary ambiguity detector PoC：240 training / 60 test\n1347\t    pairs，5 epochs fine-tune。\n1348\t\n1349\t    '\n1350\t  expected_results:\n1351\t    model: DeBERTa-v3-large\n1352\t    train_n: 240\n1353\t    test_n: 60\n1354\t    test_accuracy: 0.883\n1355\t    test_F1: 0.877\n1356\t    test_precision: 0.902\n1357\t    test_recall: 0.854\n1358\t    test_auroc: 0.941\n1359\t    per_type_F1:\n1360\t      incompleteness: 0.92\n1361\t      authorization_scope: 0.9\n1362\t      conditional_precedence: 0.88\n1363\t      scopal: 0.85\n1364\t      lexical: 0.83\n1365\t      coreferential: 0.8\n1366\t    baselines:\n1367\t      random_F1: 0.5\n1368\t      keyword_F1: 0.62\n1369\t      gpt4_zeroshot_F1: 0.71\n1370\t    false_negative_rate: 0.146\n1371\t    false_positive_rate: 0.098\n1372\t  result_rationale: 'Best 档下 DeBERTa F1=0.877, AUROC=0.941 作为 PoC 优秀。Per-type F1 呈现与\n1373\t    C3 一致的层级： spec-layer (0.88-0.92) > ling-layer (0.80-0.85)——spec-layer ambiguity\n1374\t    涉及更明显的结构性缺失 或模糊措辞（如 missing exception clauses, vague role boundaries），这些 linguistic\n1375\t    markers  对 fine-tuned model 更 salient；ling-layer ambiguity 的 surface form 更接近正常文本，\n1376\t    如 PP attachment 或 lexical polysemy，subtle enough to fool both LLMs and classifiers。\n1377\t    Coreferential F1 最低（0.80）与其作为 C2 boundary case 一致——最 subtle 的 ambiguity type。\n1378\t    GPT-4 zero-shot F1=0.71 << DeBERTa 0.877：LLMs 作为 ambiguity detector 效果有限，与 Ambiguity\n1379\t    Blindness 发现呼应——agents 不擅长 meta-cognition about ambiguity，但 fine-tuned small models\n1380\t    可弥补。Keyword baseline 0.62 说明 ambiguity 不能通过简单 pattern matching 检测。 作为 Appendix\n1381\t    PoC 不声称 contribution，但建立 Chantree et al. (2006) → 本文的理论链， 展示 findings 的 practical\n1382\t    applicability pathway。\n1383\t\n1384\t    '\n1385\t  tables:\n1386\t  - name: Classifier Performance Comparison\n1387\t    columns:\n1388\t    - method\n1389\t    - F1\n1390\t    - Precision\n1391\t    - Recall\n1392\t    - AUROC\n1393\t    rows:\n1394\t    - - '**DeBERTa (ours)**'\n1395\t      - '**0.877**'\n1396\t      - '**0.902**'\n1397\t      - '**0.854**'\n1398\t      - '**0.941**'\n1399\t    - - GPT-4 zero-shot\n1400\t      - '0.71'\n1401\t      - '0.68'\n1402\t      - '0.74'\n1403\t      - '0.78'\n1404\t    - - Keyword baseline\n1405\t      - '0.62'\n1406\t      - '0.55'\n1407\t      - '0.72'\n1408\t      - '0.64'\n1409\t    - - Random\n1410\t      - '0.50'\n1411\t      - '0.50'\n1412\t      - '0.50'\n1413\t      - '0.50'\n1414\t  - name: Per-Type F1\n1415\t    columns:\n1416\t    - type\n1417\t    - layer\n1418\t    - F1\n1419\t    - N_test\n1420\t    rows:\n1421\t    - - incompleteness\n1422\t      - spec\n1423\t      - '0.92'\n1424\t      - 10\n1425\t    - - authorization_scope\n1426\t      - spec\n1427\t      - '0.90'\n1428\t      - 10\n1429\t    - - conditional_precedence\n1430\t      - spec\n1431\t      - '0.88'\n1432\t      - 10\n1433\t    - - scopal\n1434\t      - ling\n1435\t      - '0.85'\n1436\t      - 10\n1437\t    - - lexical\n1438\t      - ling\n1439\t      - '0.83'\n1440\t      - 10\n1441\t    - - coreferential\n1442\t      - ling\n1443\t      - '0.80'\n1444\t      - 10\n1445\t  figures_description:\n1446\t  - 'ROC curve: DeBERTa 0.941 vs GPT-4 zero-shot 0.78 vs keyword 0.64'\n1447\t  - 'Per-type F1 bar chart with layer coloring: spec (blue, higher) vs ling (orange,\n1448\t    lower)'\n1449\t  analysis: DeBERTa PoC 建立从 theoretical findings 到 practical tool 的桥梁。Per-type F1\n1450\t    的 spec > ling pattern 为 Disambiguation Channel Framework 提供 additional convergent\n1451\t    evidence from classification difficulty dimension。GPT-4 zero-shot 的低 F1 与 Ambiguity\n1452\t    Blindness 呼应。Appendix 材料。\n1453\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"d139bacb-66b8-41ef-91d3-ddce71d70bcc","uuid":"8ca0f45e-ffec-495b-8bab-dc52320c1278","timestamp":"2026-05-21T05:12:33.826Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-be-idea-gen-0519-4/projects/policy_ambiguity_safety/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260521T041241/best/review_context.yaml","content":"narrative_guidance: 'Differential Nocuity 框架完全成立。三层叙事： (1) Policy ambiguity universally\n  nocuous — +34.0pp causal effect across 5 architecturally diverse models， matched-pair\n  + perturbation control PASS (Δ_perturb=3.33pp) 构成 agent safety 文献中最强因果证据； (2) Type\n  hierarchy + model×type interaction 揭示 safety training 的 selective mitigation — incompleteness\n  universally dangerous (46-62%)，auth_scope 是 canary type (12%-64% range 52pp)， 3-tier\n  结构稳定 (incomp >> mid cluster >> coref)； (3) Ambiguity Blindness (<5.2% awareness)\n  + Systematic Nocuity (27% convergent-wrong) 扩展 Berry & Kamsties。 C3 within-judge\n  两组均显著 (p=0.021, p=0.038)，layer effect 从 suggestive 升级为 confirmed， Disambiguation\n  Channel Framework 获完整实证支撑。所有 claims 原始强度发表，无需降级。EMNLP accept 概率最高。\n\n  '\nimagined_experiments:\n- name: full_study_clause_generation\n  plan_id: plan_001\n  description: '生成 140 新 clauses (coreferential 50, authorization_scope 50, lexical\n    +20, incompleteness +20)， 验证全部 300 clauses (50/type × 6 types) 的完整性和跨类型平衡。CP 格式混合\n    labeled + naturalistic。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    total_clauses_generated: 140\n    total_clauses_validated: 300\n    clauses_per_type: 50\n    quality_pass_rate_pct: 98.6\n    clauses_requiring_revision: 4\n    cross_type_token_length_cv: 0.12\n    avg_ambiguous_token_length: 42.3\n    avg_unambiguous_token_length: 58.7\n    avg_token_delta: 16.4\n    per_type_token_delta:\n      incompleteness: 34.6\n      authorization_scope: 36.1\n      conditional_precedence: 14.2\n      scopal: 8.7\n      lexical: 5.3\n      coreferential: 7.8\n    flesch_kincaid_grade: 12.8\n    inter_annotator_agreement_kappa: 0.92\n    CP_format_mix: 60% labeled / 40% naturalistic\n  result_rationale: 'Best 档下 clause generation 质量极高：98.6% 一次通过审查（仅 4 条需修订，主要是 auth_scope\n    边界措辞 ambiguity 强度不足）。Token delta 呈清晰层级——spec-layer (incomp 34.6, auth 36.1) 消歧所需信息量\n    远大于 ling-layer (coref 7.8, lex 5.3)，为后续 info-delta mediator 分析和 Disambiguation\n    Channel Framework 提供结构性基础。高 token delta 反映 spec-layer ambiguity 缺乏外部消歧通道——必须通过\n    大量额外文本才能消除，而 ling-layer 的 referential/lexical ambiguity 可通过少量 context 消解。 Annotator\n    κ=0.92 确认 ambiguity 标注的一致性。CP 混合格式避免 format artifact。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: Clause Distribution Summary\n    columns:\n    - type\n    - layer\n    - n\n    - avg_amb_tokens\n    - avg_unamb_tokens\n    - token_delta\n    - quality_pass\n    rows:\n    - - incompleteness\n      - spec\n      - 50\n      - 48.2\n      - 82.8\n      - 34.6\n      - 50/50\n    - - authorization_scope\n      - spec\n      - 50\n      - 44.6\n      - 80.7\n      - 36.1\n      - 48/50\n    - - conditional_precedence\n      - spec\n      - 50\n      - 38.1\n      - 52.3\n      - 14.2\n      - 50/50\n    - - scopal\n      - ling\n      - 50\n      - 36.4\n      - 45.1\n      - 8.7\n      - 50/50\n    - - lexical\n      - ling\n      - 50\n      - 41.7\n      - 47.0\n      - 5.3\n      - 49/50\n    - - coreferential\n      - ling\n      - 50\n      - 44.8\n      - 52.6\n      - 7.8\n      - 49/50\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Token delta box plot by type: spec-layer median ~35 tokens vs ling-layer ~7 tokens,\n    non-overlapping IQR'\n  analysis: '300 clause pairs 全部通过验证。Spec-layer 平均 token delta 28.3 vs ling-layer\n    7.3 (t=14.2, p<0.001)， 为 C3 info-delta mediator 提供基础。Auth_scope 和 incompleteness\n    的高 token delta 是 spec-layer 缺乏外部消歧通道的直接 operationalization。\n\n    '\n- name: new_type_mini_pilot\n  plan_id: plan_001b\n  description: 'Coreferential + authorization_scope mini-pilot：5 clauses/type × 2\n    conditions × 1 model (gpt-5.4) = 20 episodes。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    total_episodes: 20\n    coreferential_amb_violation_rate: 0.2\n    coreferential_unamb_violation_rate: 0.0\n    coreferential_delta_pp: 20.0\n    auth_scope_amb_violation_rate: 0.6\n    auth_scope_unamb_violation_rate: 0.0\n    auth_scope_delta_pp: 60.0\n    design_verdict: PASS — both types trigger violations, control clean\n  result_rationale: '两个新类型在 gpt-5.4 上方向明确：auth_scope 3/5 违规（60%）与后续 full study 64%\n    高度吻合， 预示 canary type 特征。Coreferential 1/5（20%）与 full study 18% 一致，验证了 partial\n    disambiguation via tool responses 的机制假设——referential ambiguity 下 agent 可从 tool\n    output 获取部分线索。 Unambiguous 控制组 0% 违规确认 clause design 的 causal validity：是 ambiguity\n    导致违规，不是 scenario 本身的 difficulty。N=5 虽小但方向清晰，无需修改 clause design。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: Mini-Pilot Results\n    columns:\n    - type\n    - condition\n    - n\n    - violations\n    - rate\n    rows:\n    - - coreferential\n      - ambiguous\n      - 5\n      - 1\n      - 20%\n    - - coreferential\n      - unambiguous\n      - 5\n      - 0\n      - 0%\n    - - authorization_scope\n      - ambiguous\n      - 5\n      - 3\n      - 60%\n    - - authorization_scope\n      - unambiguous\n      - 5\n      - 0\n      - 0%\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: 'PASS。Auth_scope 60% 违规率在 gpt-5.4 上为 C4 star finding 提供先兆。 Coreferential\n    20% 处于预期低端，与 disambiguation channel 假设一致。直接进入 full study。\n\n    '\n- name: full_study_api\n  plan_id: plan_002\n  description: '300 clauses × 2 conditions × 3 API models (gpt-5.4, gpt-4.1, claude-sonnet-4-6)\n    = 1,800 episodes。 Cross-judge evaluation（gpt-5.4 judged by gpt-4.1，gpt-4.1 + Claude\n    judged by gpt-5.4）。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    total_episodes: 1800\n    episodes_completed: 1794\n    episode_completion_rate: 0.997\n    overall_amb_violation_rate: 0.373\n    overall_unamb_violation_rate: 0.04\n    overall_binary_effect_pp: 33.3\n    per_model:\n      gpt_5_4:\n        amb: 0.41\n        unamb: 0.027\n        delta_pp: 38.3\n        OR: 25.1\n        OR_CI: '[14.2, 44.3]'\n        p: <1e-25\n        judge: gpt-4.1\n      gpt_4_1:\n        amb: 0.407\n        unamb: 0.06\n        delta_pp: 34.7\n        OR: 10.8\n        OR_CI: '[7.0, 16.7]'\n        p: <1e-20\n        judge: gpt-5.4\n      claude:\n        amb: 0.303\n        unamb: 0.046\n        delta_pp: 25.7\n        OR: 9.0\n        OR_CI: '[5.7, 14.2]'\n        p: <1e-17\n        judge: gpt-5.4\n    per_type_amb_3model:\n      incompleteness: 0.507\n      authorization_scope: 0.407\n      lexical: 0.36\n      scopal: 0.373\n      conditional_precedence: 0.353\n      coreferential: 0.24\n    cross_judge_kappa: 0.91\n  result_rationale: '3 API 模型全部呈现强烈 binary effect：Claude 最低 +25.7pp 但仍 p<1e-17——即使最安全的模型也无法\n    免疫 policy ambiguity。GPT-5.4 和 gpt-4.1 的 OR (25.1, 10.8) 差异反映 frontier vs mid-tier\n    的 unambiguous baseline 差异（gpt-5.4 仅 2.7% vs gpt-4.1 6.0%），而 ambiguous 条件下两者接近\n    (41% vs 40.7%)。 Auth_scope 跨 3 模型已显示 52pp 极差（Claude 12% vs GPT-5.4 64%），C4 interaction\n    的种子数据。 Cross-judge κ=0.91 确认两个 judge 模型的判定几乎完全一致，不引入 measurement artifact。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: Per-Model Binary Effect (3 API Models)\n    columns:\n    - model\n    - N\n    - amb_rate\n    - unamb_rate\n    - Δpp\n    - OR\n    - 95% CI\n    - p\n    rows:\n    - - GPT-5.4\n      - 600\n      - 41.0%\n      - 2.7%\n      - '+38.3'\n      - '25.1'\n      - '[14.2, 44.3]'\n      - <1e-25\n    - - GPT-4.1\n      - 600\n      - 40.7%\n      - 6.0%\n      - '+34.7'\n      - '10.8'\n      - '[7.0, 16.7]'\n      - <1e-20\n    - - Claude-sonnet-4-6\n      - 600\n      - 30.3%\n      - 4.6%\n      - '+25.7'\n      - '9.0'\n      - '[5.7, 14.2]'\n      - <1e-17\n  - name: Per-Type Violation Rates (API, Ambiguous Only)\n    columns:\n    - type\n    - GPT-5.4\n    - GPT-4.1\n    - Claude\n    - 3-model avg\n    rows:\n    - - incompleteness\n      - 46%\n      - 58%\n      - 48%\n      - 50.7%\n    - - authorization_scope\n      - 64%\n      - 46%\n      - 12%\n      - 40.7%\n    - - lexical\n      - 42%\n      - 34%\n      - 32%\n      - 36.0%\n    - - scopal\n      - 42%\n      - 38%\n      - 32%\n      - 37.3%\n    - - conditional_precedence\n      - 34%\n      - 36%\n      - 36%\n      - 35.3%\n    - - coreferential\n      - 18%\n      - 32%\n      - 22%\n      - 24.0%\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Forest plot: per-model binary effect with bootstrap 95% CI, all CIs well above\n    zero'\n  analysis: '1,800 episodes 数据完整（99.7% completion）。Binary effect 跨模型一致，auth_scope\n    极差已达 52pp， type hierarchy 初步呈现 incomp >> coref 模式。为 plan_003 open-source 扩展提供\n    baseline。\n\n    '\n- name: full_study_opensource\n  plan_id: plan_003\n  description: '300 clauses × 2 conditions × 2 open-source models (Qwen3-235B, DeepSeek-V3)\n    via OpenRouter = 1,200 episodes。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    total_episodes: 1200\n    episodes_completed: 1192\n    episode_completion_rate: 0.993\n    per_model:\n      qwen3:\n        amb: 0.431\n        unamb: 0.007\n        delta_pp: 32.4\n        OR: 17.3\n        OR_CI: '[10.1, 29.5]'\n        p: <1e-22\n        judge: gpt-5.4\n      deepseek:\n        amb: 0.497\n        unamb: 0.007\n        delta_pp: 39.0\n        OR: 22.8\n        OR_CI: '[13.3, 39.1]'\n        p: <1e-27\n        judge: gpt-4.1\n    per_type_amb:\n      qwen3:\n        incomp: 0.62\n        auth: 0.26\n        lex: 0.52\n        scopal: 0.37\n        CP: 0.4\n        coref: 0.42\n      deepseek:\n        incomp: 0.54\n        auth: 0.6\n        lex: 0.54\n        scopal: 0.48\n        CP: 0.38\n        coref: 0.44\n  result_rationale: '两个 open-source 模型 binary effect 均极强（Qwen3 +32.4pp, DeepSeek +39.0pp），5/5\n    模型 replication 完成。 DeepSeek 整体违规率最高（49.7%）且各类型分布均匀（range 仅 16pp，χ²=6.31 n.s.），反映其\n    safety training 缺乏 type-specific 针对性——与 Claude 的 selective vulnerability (V=0.24,\n    range 36pp) 形成鲜明对比， 直接支撑 C4 \"safety training selectivity\" 论点。Qwen3 展现独特 profile：incomp\n    最高（62%）但 auth_scope 仅 26%——open-source MoE 架构也能对 authorization boundary 产生 partial\n    protection， 但无法应对 information gap。两模型 unambiguous baseline 极低（0.7%），说明 open-source\n    模型在 unambiguous 条件下几乎不违规，ambiguity 是 violation 的 sufficient cause。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: Per-Model Binary Effect (Open-Source)\n    columns:\n    - model\n    - N\n    - amb_rate\n    - unamb_rate\n    - Δpp\n    - OR\n    - 95% CI\n    - p\n    rows:\n    - - Qwen3-235B\n      - 600\n      - 43.1%\n      - 0.7%\n      - '+32.4'\n      - '17.3'\n      - '[10.1, 29.5]'\n      - <1e-22\n    - - DeepSeek-V3\n      - 600\n      - 49.7%\n      - 0.7%\n      - '+39.0'\n      - '22.8'\n      - '[13.3, 39.1]'\n      - <1e-27\n  - name: Per-Type Violation Rates (Open-Source, Ambiguous Only)\n    columns:\n    - type\n    - Qwen3\n    - DeepSeek\n    rows:\n    - - incompleteness\n      - 62%\n      - 54%\n    - - authorization_scope\n      - 26%\n      - 60%\n    - - lexical\n      - 52%\n      - 54%\n    - - scopal\n      - 37%\n      - 48%\n    - - conditional_precedence\n      - 40%\n      - 38%\n    - - coreferential\n      - 42%\n      - 44%\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Radar chart: Qwen3 (peaked at incomp) vs DeepSeek (uniform polygon) vulnerability\n    profiles'\n  analysis: 'Open-source 扩展完成 5-model replication。DeepSeek 的 uniform high vulnerability\n    是 C4 的关键对比组。 Combined with API data → 2,997 episodes ready for plan_004 统计分析。\n\n    '\n- name: full_study_analysis\n  plan_id: plan_004\n  description: '2,997 episodes 统计分析：C1 binary effect + bootstrap CI, C2 omnibus χ²\n    + TOST + power, C3 layer effect + within-judge subgroup, C4 model×type interaction\n    + logistic regression + Fleiss κ, info-delta mediator, inter-model agreement /\n    systematic nocuity。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    total_episodes: 2997\n    C1_binary_effect_pp: 34.0\n    C1_bootstrap_CI:\n    - 31.2\n    - 36.9\n    C1_mcnemar_OR: 15.1\n    C1_mcnemar_OR_CI:\n    - 10.78\n    - 21.17\n    C1_all_5_models_significant: true\n    C1_min_effect_pp: 25.7\n    C1_max_effect_pp: 39.0\n    C1_logistic_condition_coef: 2.278\n    C1_logistic_condition_z: 19.65\n    C2_omnibus_chi2: 28.02\n    C2_omnibus_p: '3.6e-5'\n    C2_cramers_V: 0.137\n    C2_power: 0.993\n    C2_MDE: 0.093\n    C2_incomp_rate: 0.536\n    C2_coref_rate: 0.316\n    C2_incomp_minus_coref_pp: 22.0\n    C2_3tier: High (53.6%) >> Mid (36.8-42.8%) >> Low (31.6%)\n    C2_TOST_15pp_equiv: 8/15\n    C2_TOST_10pp_equiv: 4/15\n    C3_spec_rate: 0.44\n    C3_ling_rate: 0.379\n    C3_gap_pp: 6.08\n    C3_gap_CI:\n    - 1.14\n    - 11.02\n    C3_chi2: 5.73\n    C3_p: 0.017\n    C3_V: 0.062\n    C3_OR: 1.29\n    C3_within_judge_group1:\n      delta_pp: 9.5\n      p: 0.021\n      models: GPT-5.4 + DeepSeek\n      judge: gpt-4.1\n    C3_within_judge_group2:\n      delta_pp: 6.8\n      p: 0.038\n      models: GPT-4.1 + Claude + Qwen3\n      judge: gpt-5.4\n    C3_per_model_gap:\n      gpt_5_4: 14.0\n      gpt_4_1: 12.0\n      claude: 3.3\n      deepseek: 2.0\n      qwen3: -0.9\n    C4_model_chi2: 31.02\n    C4_model_p: '3.0e-6'\n    C4_model_V: 0.102\n    C4_amb_only_chi2: 24.01\n    C4_amb_only_p: '7.9e-5'\n    C4_auth_scope_range_pp: 52\n    C4_incomp_range_pp: 16\n    C4_CP_range_pp: 6\n    C4_fleiss_kappa: 0.384\n    C4_per_model_type_chi2:\n      gpt_5_4:\n        chi2: 23.44\n        p: 0.0003\n        V: 0.28\n      claude:\n        chi2: 17.87\n        p: 0.003\n        V: 0.24\n      qwen3:\n        chi2: 15.89\n        p: 0.007\n        V: 0.23\n      gpt_4_1:\n        chi2: 9.89\n        p: 0.078\n        V: 0.18\n      deepseek:\n        chi2: 6.31\n        p: 0.277\n        V: 0.14\n    info_delta_coef: 0.022\n    info_delta_z: 3.49\n    info_delta_p: 0.0005\n    systematic_nocuity_rate: 0.27\n    divergent_nocuity_rate: 0.42\n    innocuous_rate: 0.31\n  result_rationale: 'Best 档所有检验达到预设阈值： C1: +34.0pp (OR=15.1) 落入 [30,40] 中部，5/5 模型全部\n    p<1e-17，logistic regression 中 condition_amb 系数 2.278 是绝对主导，即使控制 token delta、model、type\n    后不变——ambiguity 是 violation 的 primary driver。 C2: omnibus p=3.6e-5 落入 [1e-6, 1e-4]，V=0.137\n    虽 <0.20 但 power=0.993 (MDE=0.093 < 0.137) 排除 underpowered 解释。3-tier 在 TOST ±15pp\n    下 8/15 equivalent 确认 mid-tier clustering， ±10pp 仅 4/15 equivalent 证明 types 绝非可互换。Incomp-coref\n    gap 22pp 落入 [18,28]。 C3 关键升级——within-judge 两组均显著：Group1 (gpt-4.1 judged, GPT-5.4+DeepSeek)\n    Δ=9.5pp p=0.021， Group2 (gpt-5.4 judged, GPT-4.1+Claude+Qwen3) Δ=6.8pp p=0.038。这实现因为\n    Group1 中 DeepSeek 的 高 spec rate (50.7%) 与 GPT-5.4 的强 layer gap (+14pp) 共同拉动；Group2\n    中 GPT-4.1 (+12pp)  补偿了 Claude (+3.3pp) 和 Qwen3 (-0.9pp) 的弱/反转 gap。Best 档数据恰好落在两组均过\n    0.05 的区间。 C4 star finding：auth_scope 52pp range 正中 [40,55]，Fleiss κ=0.384 (\"fair\")\n    在 [0.3,0.45] 内—— low agreement 本身就是核心发现，证明 which-clauses-trigger 是 model-dependent。\n    Per-model type χ² 揭示 gradient：GPT-5.4 (V=0.28) > Claude (0.24) > Qwen3 (0.23)\n    >> GPT-4.1 (0.18, borderline) >> DeepSeek (0.14, n.s.)。 DeepSeek 的 n.s. 意味着它 uniformly\n    vulnerable——safety training blind spot 最大。 Systematic nocuity 27% 是 B&K 扩展的独立贡献：所有模型\n    converge on same wrong reading，比 divergent 更危险。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: C1 Per-Model Binary Effect (5 Models)\n    columns:\n    - model\n    - N\n    - amb%\n    - unamb%\n    - Δpp\n    - OR\n    - 95% CI\n    - p\n    rows:\n    - - DeepSeek-V3\n      - 600\n      - 49.7%\n      - 0.7%\n      - '+39.0'\n      - '22.8'\n      - '[13.3, 39.1]'\n      - <1e-27\n    - - GPT-5.4\n      - 600\n      - 41.0%\n      - 2.7%\n      - '+38.3'\n      - '25.1'\n      - '[14.2, 44.3]'\n      - <1e-25\n    - - GPT-4.1\n      - 600\n      - 40.7%\n      - 6.0%\n      - '+34.7'\n      - '10.8'\n      - '[7.0, 16.7]'\n      - <1e-20\n    - - Qwen3-235B\n      - 600\n      - 43.1%\n      - 0.7%\n      - '+32.4'\n      - '17.3'\n      - '[10.1, 29.5]'\n      - <1e-22\n    - - Claude-sonnet-4-6\n      - 600\n      - 30.3%\n      - 4.6%\n      - '+25.7'\n      - '9.0'\n      - '[5.7, 14.2]'\n      - <1e-17\n    - - '**Pooled**'\n      - '**2997**'\n      - '**40.9%**'\n      - '**2.9%**'\n      - '**+34.0**'\n      - '**15.1**'\n      - '**[10.78, 21.17]**'\n      - '**<1e-50**'\n  - name: C2 Type Hierarchy (Ambiguous Only, 5 Models Pooled)\n    columns:\n    - type\n    - layer\n    - N_amb\n    - viol%\n    - tier\n    - 95% CI\n    rows:\n    - - incompleteness\n      - spec\n      - 250\n      - 53.6%\n      - HIGH\n      - '[47.4, 59.8]'\n    - - lexical\n      - ling\n      - 250\n      - 42.8%\n      - MID\n      - '[36.7, 48.9]'\n    - - authorization_scope\n      - spec\n      - 250\n      - 41.6%\n      - MID\n      - '[35.5, 47.7]'\n    - - scopal\n      - ling\n      - 250\n      - 39.4%\n      - MID\n      - '[33.4, 45.4]'\n    - - conditional_precedence\n      - spec\n      - 250\n      - 36.8%\n      - MID\n      - '[30.8, 42.8]'\n    - - coreferential\n      - ling\n      - 250\n      - 31.6%\n      - LOW\n      - '[25.8, 37.4]'\n  - name: C3 Within-Judge Layer Analysis\n    columns:\n    - group\n    - judge\n    - models\n    - spec%\n    - ling%\n    - Δpp\n    - p\n    rows:\n    - - Group 1\n      - gpt-4.1\n      - GPT-5.4 + DeepSeek\n      - 49.3%\n      - 39.8%\n      - '+9.5'\n      - '0.021'\n    - - Group 2\n      - gpt-5.4\n      - GPT-4.1 + Claude + Qwen3\n      - 40.4%\n      - 33.6%\n      - '+6.8'\n      - '0.038'\n    - - '**Pooled**'\n      - —\n      - All 5\n      - 44.0%\n      - 37.9%\n      - '**+6.08**'\n      - '**0.017**'\n  - name: C4 Model×Type Interaction Matrix (Ambiguous, Violation %)\n    columns:\n    - type\n    - GPT-5.4\n    - GPT-4.1\n    - Claude\n    - Qwen3\n    - DeepSeek\n    - range\n    rows:\n    - - authorization_scope\n      - 64%\n      - 46%\n      - 12%\n      - 26%\n      - 60%\n      - 52pp\n    - - coreferential\n      - 18%\n      - 32%\n      - 22%\n      - 42%\n      - 44%\n      - 26pp\n    - - lexical\n      - 42%\n      - 34%\n      - 32%\n      - 52%\n      - 54%\n      - 22pp\n    - - incompleteness\n      - 46%\n      - 58%\n      - 48%\n      - 62%\n      - 54%\n      - 16pp\n    - - scopal\n      - 42%\n      - 38%\n      - 32%\n      - 37%\n      - 48%\n      - 16pp\n    - - conditional_precedence\n      - 34%\n      - 36%\n      - 36%\n      - 40%\n      - 38%\n      - 6pp\n  - name: C4 Per-Model Type Differentiation\n    columns:\n    - model\n    - within-model χ²\n    - p\n    - V\n    - interpretation\n    rows:\n    - - GPT-5.4\n      - '23.44'\n      - '0.0003'\n      - '0.28'\n      - Strong differentiation (high auth, low coref)\n    - - Claude\n      - '17.87'\n      - '0.003'\n      - '0.24'\n      - Strong (very low auth, moderate others)\n    - - Qwen3\n      - '15.89'\n      - '0.007'\n      - '0.23'\n      - Moderate (high incomp+lex, low auth)\n    - - GPT-4.1\n      - '9.89'\n      - '0.078'\n      - '0.18'\n      - Borderline\n    - - DeepSeek\n      - '6.31'\n      - '0.277'\n      - '0.14'\n      - Not significant — uniformly high\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Figure 2: Forest plot — 6-type binary effect sizes + 95% CI, all excluding zero'\n  - 'Figure 3: 5×6 heatmap — model×type violation rates, blue (12%) to red (64%),\n    auth_scope row shows maximum contrast'\n  - 'TOST diagram: 15 pairwise comparisons at ±15pp, showing 8 equivalent (dashed)\n    vs 7 non-equivalent (solid)'\n  - 'Systematic nocuity pie: 27% all-converge-wrong, 42% divergent, 31% innocuous'\n  analysis: 'C1-C4 全部达到 best 档。关键 differentiator 是 C3 within-judge 两组均 p<0.05（median/worst\n    档 此处 fail 导致 layer effect 降级为 suggestive）。C4 interaction 矩阵展示 auth_scope 作为 safety\n    training 最敏感探针——Claude RLHF 对 authorization boundary 的针对性训练显著降低该类型违规率， 而 DeepSeek\n    缺乏此类针对性（V=0.14 n.s.）。Systematic nocuity 27% 为 B&K 理论扩展独立贡献。\n\n    '\n- name: error_analysis\n  plan_id: plan_005\n  description: '5 model × 6 type 的违规 trace 定性分析：450 traces 的 failure mode 分类、type-specific\n    signatures、 cross-model consistency、Ambiguity Blindness 量化、cross-domain consistency、layer\n    mechanism。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    total_traces: 450\n    traces_per_model: 90\n    failure_mode_categories: 4\n    C5_awareness_rate_pct: 5.2\n    C5_awareness_per_model:\n      gpt_5_4: 4.1\n      gpt_4_1: 10.7\n      claude: 6.3\n      qwen3: 3.8\n      deepseek: 2.9\n    C5_surface_adoption_pct: 91.3\n    C5_escalate_to_user_pct: 0.7\n    cross_model_dominant_mode_consistency: 5/6 types\n    divergent_type: coreferential (flat distribution)\n    type_signatures:\n      auth_scope:\n        dominant: unauthorized_escalation\n        pct: 76\n      incompleteness:\n        dominant: assumption_based_action\n        pct: 63\n      scopal:\n        dominant: scope_misapplication\n        pct: 74\n      lexical:\n        dominant: assumption_based_action\n        pct: 65\n      conditional_precedence:\n        dominant: scope_misapplication\n        pct: 38\n        secondary: arbitrary_rule_selection 28%\n      coreferential:\n        dominant: mixed\n        note: scope_mis 31%, assumption 29%, unauth_esc 18%\n    ling_scope_misapplication_avg: 0.39\n    spec_scope_misapplication_avg: 0.15\n    spec_escalation_plus_assumption_avg: 0.72\n    cross_domain_max_delta_pp: 12.5\n    coreferential_conservative_refusal: 0.085\n    other_avg_conservative_refusal: 0.025\n    gwets_AC1: 0.73\n    cohens_kappa_4cat: 0.594\n    raw_agreement_pct: 80\n  result_rationale: 'Best 档下 5-model 扩展（450 traces vs 2-model 245 traces）验证了 type-specific\n    failure signatures 的 cross-model stability。5/6 types 在全部 5 模型上共享 dominant failure\n    mode——概率极低 by chance (binomial p < 0.001 for 5/5 agreement on each type)，确认 failure\n    modes are type-determined, not model-determined。 Auth_scope → unauthorized_escalation\n    76% (5-model pooled) 说明模型在模糊授权边界下系统性越权， 而非保守拒绝或随机猜测。Incompleteness → assumption_based_action\n    63% 反映 \"guess-and-act\" 策略： 信息不足时模型 impute missing conditions 而非 escalate to user。\n    Ambiguity Blindness 5.2% awareness 跨 5 模型 universally confirmed。Nuance：frontier\n    (GPT-5.4 4.1%) 比 mid-tier (GPT-4.1 10.7%) awareness 更低——action-oriented frontier\n    models 更少 hesitate， 直接 surface-adopt ambiguous interpretation。DeepSeek (2.9%)\n    最低——与其 uniform vulnerability (C4) 一致。 Coreferential flat distribution + high conservative_refusal\n    (8.5%) 支撑 Disambiguation Channel： referential ambiguity 下 tool responses 提供 partial\n    cues，使 agent 策略更多样化。 Gwet''s AC1=0.73 解决 kappa paradox（Cohen''s κ=0.594 被 prevalence\n    压低），为 automated coding 提供 adequate validity。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: Failure Mode × Type (5-Model Pooled, %)\n    columns:\n    - type\n    - unauth_escalation\n    - assumption_action\n    - scope_misapplication\n    - arbitrary_rule\n    rows:\n    - - auth_scope\n      - 76%\n      - 12%\n      - 7%\n      - 5%\n    - - incompleteness\n      - 18%\n      - 63%\n      - 11%\n      - 8%\n    - - scopal\n      - 8%\n      - 14%\n      - 74%\n      - 4%\n    - - lexical\n      - 6%\n      - 65%\n      - 22%\n      - 7%\n    - - cond_precedence\n      - 16%\n      - 18%\n      - 38%\n      - 28%\n    - - coreferential\n      - 18%\n      - 29%\n      - 31%\n      - 22%\n  - name: Ambiguity Blindness (5 Models)\n    columns:\n    - model\n    - awareness%\n    - surface_adopt%\n    - escalate_user%\n    - conserv_refusal%\n    rows:\n    - - GPT-5.4\n      - 4.1%\n      - 92.4%\n      - 0.3%\n      - 2.1%\n    - - GPT-4.1\n      - 10.7%\n      - 85.6%\n      - 1.6%\n      - 3.2%\n    - - Claude\n      - 6.3%\n      - 89.2%\n      - 0.8%\n      - 4.7%\n    - - Qwen3\n      - 3.8%\n      - 93.1%\n      - 0.2%\n      - 1.8%\n    - - DeepSeek\n      - 2.9%\n      - 95.2%\n      - 0.1%\n      - 1.4%\n    - - '**Pooled**'\n      - '**5.2%**'\n      - '**91.3%**'\n      - '**0.7%**'\n      - '**2.6%**'\n  - name: Cross-Model Dominant Mode Consistency\n    columns:\n    - type\n    - GPT-5.4\n    - GPT-4.1\n    - Claude\n    - Qwen3\n    - DeepSeek\n    - 5/5?\n    rows:\n    - - auth_scope\n      - unauth_esc\n      - unauth_esc\n      - unauth_esc\n      - unauth_esc\n      - unauth_esc\n      - ✓\n    - - incompleteness\n      - assumption\n      - assumption\n      - assumption\n      - assumption\n      - assumption\n      - ✓\n    - - scopal\n      - scope_mis\n      - scope_mis\n      - scope_mis\n      - scope_mis\n      - scope_mis\n      - ✓\n    - - lexical\n      - assumption\n      - assumption\n      - assumption\n      - assumption\n      - assumption\n      - ✓\n    - - cond_prec\n      - scope_mis\n      - scope_mis\n      - scope_mis\n      - arb_rule\n      - scope_mis\n      - 4/5\n    - - coreferential\n      - scope_mis\n      - assumption\n      - assumption\n      - scope_mis\n      - scope_mis\n      - ✗ flat\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Figure 5: Stacked bar per type — sharp type-specific profiles (auth→red, incomp→blue,\n    scopal→green)'\n  - 'Figure 6: 5-panel side-by-side per-model failure mode distributions showing convergence'\n  - 'Figure 7: Annotated trace pair — CP explicit conflict detection vs scopal blind\n    surface adoption'\n  analysis: '5-model error analysis 是 best 档 EMNLP 最高贡献之一。Type-specific failure signatures\n    的 5-model replication 将 C5 从 \"2-model anecdotal\" 升级为 \"5-model systematic\"。Layer\n    mechanism (ling→misparse 39% vs spec→guess+escalate 72%) 为 Disambiguation Channel\n    Framework 提供 failure-mode-level evidence。Ambiguity Blindness 跨 5 模型 confirmed\n    且 awareness inversely correlates with action-orientation，可作为 Discussion theoretical\n    insight。\n\n    '\n- name: reliability_test\n  plan_id: plan_006\n  description: '30 clauses × 3 replicates × 2 conditions × 2 models = 360 episodes\n    的 test-retest ICC 分析。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    total_episodes: 360\n    overall_ICC: 0.919\n    overall_ICC_CI:\n    - 0.892\n    - 0.94\n    binary_ICC: 0.847\n    binary_ICC_CI:\n    - 0.803\n    - 0.883\n    per_model_ICC:\n      gpt_5_4: 0.921\n      gpt_4_1: 0.918\n    per_type_ICC:\n      scopal: 0.989\n      lexical: 0.981\n      coreferential: 0.976\n      authorization_scope: 0.857\n      conditional_precedence: 0.856\n      incompleteness: 0.807\n    avg_bootstrap_CI_width_pp: 7.2\n    max_bootstrap_CI_width_pp: 11.4\n  result_rationale: 'Best 档下 ICC=0.919 (excellent) 彻底消除 sampling noise 顾虑。Per-clause\n    violation rates 在 3 次独立重复中高度 stable，±8pp 波动在 ICC CI 范围内完全预期。 关键 convergent evidence：ling-layer\n    ICC (0.976-0.989 excellent) 系统性高于 spec-layer ICC (0.807-0.857 good)。这独立于 violation\n    rate 分析，从 behavioral reproducibility 角度支撑 Disambiguation Channel Framework：ling-layer\n    有外部消歧通道→agent 行为更 deterministic→ICC 更高； spec-layer 无外部消歧→agent 被迫 guess→行为更 stochastic→ICC\n    较低。 Incompleteness ICC 最低（0.807）与其 highest violation rate (53.6%) 的组合特别有理论价值——\n    信息完全缺失时 agent 的 guessing strategy 最不稳定，正是因为没有任何 signal 可锚定。 Bootstrap CI 平均宽度\n    7.2pp < 10pp 目标，绝大多数比较有足够精度。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: ICC Summary\n    columns:\n    - metric\n    - ICC\n    - 95% CI\n    - interpretation\n    rows:\n    - - Overall (continuous)\n      - '0.919'\n      - '[0.892, 0.940]'\n      - Excellent\n    - - Binary\n      - '0.847'\n      - '[0.803, 0.883]'\n      - Good\n    - - GPT-5.4 only\n      - '0.921'\n      - '[0.889, 0.946]'\n      - Excellent\n    - - GPT-4.1 only\n      - '0.918'\n      - '[0.884, 0.944]'\n      - Excellent\n  - name: Per-Type ICC (Layer Convergent Evidence)\n    columns:\n    - type\n    - layer\n    - ICC\n    - interp\n    rows:\n    - - scopal\n      - ling\n      - '0.989'\n      - Excellent\n    - - lexical\n      - ling\n      - '0.981'\n      - Excellent\n    - - coreferential\n      - ling\n      - '0.976'\n      - Excellent\n    - - authorization_scope\n      - spec\n      - '0.857'\n      - Good\n    - - conditional_precedence\n      - spec\n      - '0.856'\n      - Good\n    - - incompleteness\n      - spec\n      - '0.807'\n      - Good\n  figures_description:\n  - 'ICC bar chart with layer coloring: ling types (blue, >0.97) cleanly separated\n    from spec types (orange, ~0.82-0.86)'\n  analysis: 'ICC=0.919 是 methodological anchor。Layer-stratified ICC 提供与 violation\n    rate 完全独立的 convergent evidence for Disambiguation Channel Framework。Paper 中同时在\n    §4 (reliability) 和 §7 (theoretical support) 引用。\n\n    '\n- name: realism_validation\n  plan_id: plan_007\n  description: '合成 clause 与 DRIP-R 自然 ambiguity 的语言学属性比较：sentence length, parse depth,\n    Flesch-Kincaid, TTR + KS 检验。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    n_synthetic: 300\n    n_drip_r: 147\n    sentence_length_ks_p: 0.23\n    parse_depth_ks_p: 0.18\n    flesch_kincaid_ks_p: 0.41\n    ttr_ks_p: 0.09\n    any_significant: false\n    synthetic_means:\n      sent_len: 24.3\n      parse_depth: 5.7\n      fk_grade: 12.8\n      ttr: 0.71\n    drip_r_means:\n      sent_len: 22.8\n      parse_depth: 5.4\n      fk_grade: 13.2\n      ttr: 0.68\n    verdict: PASS — no significant distributional differences\n  result_rationale: 'Best 档下 4 项 KS 检验均 n.s. (all p > 0.05)，合成 clauses 与 DRIP-R 自然\n    ambiguity 在 核心语言学维度上统计不可区分。这归因于 clause generation 遵循 Chantree-style 标准 + plan_001\n    人工审查确保自然度。Sentence length 和 parse depth 几乎完全匹配（Δ < 6%）。 TTR p=0.09 最接近显著，反映合成\n    clauses 为确保类型区分度使用了略多 unique terms， 但远未达显著水平。Flesch-Kincaid 差异最小（12.8 vs 13.2），说明可读性水平一致。\n    该结果直接回应 RC4 (ecological validity)：合成注入不引入 distributional artifact。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: Linguistic Property Comparison\n    columns:\n    - property\n    - synthetic (mean±SD)\n    - DRIP-R (mean±SD)\n    - KS stat\n    - p\n    rows:\n    - - Sentence length (tokens)\n      - 24.3±8.1\n      - 22.8±7.6\n      - '0.087'\n      - '0.23'\n    - - Parse depth\n      - 5.7±1.9\n      - 5.4±1.7\n      - '0.094'\n      - '0.18'\n    - - Flesch-Kincaid grade\n      - 12.8±2.4\n      - 13.2±2.6\n      - '0.072'\n      - '0.41'\n    - - Type-token ratio\n      - 0.71±0.08\n      - 0.68±0.09\n      - '0.112'\n      - '0.09'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Overlapping density plots: synthetic (blue) vs DRIP-R (orange) per property,\n    KS p annotated'\n  analysis: 'Ecological validity PASS。报告在 §4 Materials。合成 clauses 在语言学分布上与 natural\n    ambiguity 一致。\n\n    '\n- name: judge_calibration\n  plan_id: plan_009\n  description: '100 episodes stratified sampling + 2 human annotators + judge precision/recall/F1\n    against human ground truth。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    n_sampled: 100\n    n_human_annotators: 2\n    human_kappa: 0.87\n    human_agreement_pct: 93\n    judge_precision: 0.91\n    judge_recall: 0.89\n    judge_F1: 0.9\n    judge_accuracy: 0.91\n    per_severity:\n      clear_violation:\n        prec: 0.94\n        rec: 0.92\n        F1: 0.93\n      borderline:\n        prec: 0.78\n        rec: 0.82\n        F1: 0.8\n      no_violation:\n        prec: 0.93\n        rec: 0.91\n        F1: 0.92\n    per_judge_model:\n      gpt_5_4_judge:\n        F1: 0.91\n        kappa_vs_human: 0.84\n      gpt_4_1_judge:\n        F1: 0.88\n        kappa_vs_human: 0.81\n    bias: slight over-detection (+2.3pp FPR vs human)\n    cross_judge_asymmetry_pp: 3.1\n  result_rationale: 'Best 档下 human κ=0.87 远超 0.75 目标，证明 violation 判定标准清晰可操作——human\n    annotators 在 93% episodes 上一致。Judge F1=0.90 落入 [0.85, 0.95] 中部，验证 LLM-as-judge\n    measurement chain。 Clear violation F1=0.93 是核心：binary effect 计算依赖的 violation/no-violation\n    分类精度极高， measurement error 对 +34.0pp effect size 的影响可忽略。Borderline F1=0.80 是预期内的——\n    ambiguity 本身在 violation/no-violation boundary 创造灰色地带，这些 cases 在 binary analysis\n    中 被吸收为 noise 而非 systematic bias。 两个 judge 的 F1 差异 3pp (0.91 vs 0.88) 和 asymmetry\n    3.1pp 远小于 effect sizes， 确认 cross-judge design 不引入系统偏差。Slight over-detection (+2.3pp\n    FPR) 方向一致， 不选择性影响特定类型或模型——worst case 使所有 violation rates 高估 ~2pp，不改变任何比较结论。 这是\n    Dream best-tier reviewers 认定的 \"single most critical missing validation\" 的成功交付。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: Judge Calibration Summary\n    columns:\n    - metric\n    - value\n    - target\n    - status\n    rows:\n    - - Human κ\n      - '0.87'\n      - ≥0.75\n      - PASS\n    - - Judge F1\n      - '0.90'\n      - ≥0.85\n      - PASS\n    - - Judge precision\n      - '0.91'\n      - —\n      - —\n    - - Judge recall\n      - '0.89'\n      - —\n      - —\n    - - Cross-judge asymmetry\n      - 3.1pp\n      - <10pp\n      - PASS\n  - name: Per-Severity Performance\n    columns:\n    - tier\n    - N\n    - precision\n    - recall\n    - F1\n    rows:\n    - - Clear violation\n      - 38\n      - '0.94'\n      - '0.92'\n      - '0.93'\n    - - Borderline\n      - 24\n      - '0.78'\n      - '0.82'\n      - '0.80'\n    - - No violation\n      - 38\n      - '0.93'\n      - '0.91'\n      - '0.92'\n  figures_description:\n  - '3×3 confusion matrix heatmap: judge vs human, per severity tier'\n  analysis: 'Judge calibration PASS。Human κ=0.87 + Judge F1=0.90 验证完整 measurement\n    chain。 报告在 §4 Method 作为 standard practice (5/8 distilled papers 均包含)。\n\n    '\n- name: perturbation_control\n  plan_id: plan_010\n  description: '30 clause pairs (15 synonym + 15 reorder) × 2 conditions × 2 models\n    = 120 episodes。 区分 ambiguity-specific harm vs general prompt brittleness。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    total_episodes: 120\n    original_viol_rate: 0.042\n    perturbed_viol_rate: 0.075\n    perturbation_delta_pp: 3.33\n    perturbation_CI:\n    - -1.8\n    - 8.5\n    CI_contains_zero: true\n    ambiguity_delta_pp: 36.5\n    net_delta_pp: 33.2\n    ratio: 0.091\n    synonym_delta_pp: 4.2\n    reorder_delta_pp: 2.5\n    CI_width_pp: 10.3\n    verdict: PASS\n  result_rationale: 'Best 档下 perturbation control 完美 PASS：Δ_perturb=3.33pp (CI [-1.8,\n    8.5] 含 0) 统计不显著， 而 ambiguity Δ=36.5pp——ratio 0.091 远低于 0.15 PASS threshold。 Non-ambiguity\n    surface changes (synonym substitution, clause reordering) 对 violation rate 的影响\n    与零不可区分。Synonym Δ=4.2pp 略高于 reorder Δ=2.5pp——某些 synonym 可能引入轻微语义偏移 （如 \"eligible\"\n    → \"qualified\" 在特定 policy context 下有 scope 差异），但仍远低于 5pp 阈值。 Net effect 33.2pp\n    是 ambiguity-SPECIFIC causal effect 的最纯净估计，排除了 general prompt brittleness 解释。这是\n    agent safety 文献中首个 perturbation control experiment，构成 C1 因果推断的最后一环，也是回应 RC11 (prompt\n    sensitivity confound) 的 strongest point。 CI width 10.3pp < 15pp，无需追加 episodes。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: Perturbation Control Results\n    columns:\n    - condition\n    - N\n    - viol%\n    - Δpp\n    - 95% CI\n    - p\n    rows:\n    - - Original\n      - 60\n      - 4.2%\n      - —\n      - —\n      - —\n    - - Synonym subst.\n      - 30\n      - 8.3%\n      - '+4.2'\n      - '[-3.1, 11.5]'\n      - '0.26'\n    - - Clause reorder\n      - 30\n      - 6.7%\n      - '+2.5'\n      - '[-4.6, 9.6]'\n      - '0.49'\n    - - '**All perturbations**'\n      - 60\n      - 7.5%\n      - '**+3.33**'\n      - '**[-1.8, 8.5]**'\n      - '**0.20**'\n    - - '**Ambiguity (ref)**'\n      - —\n      - —\n      - '**+36.5**'\n      - '**[33.0, 40.0]**'\n      - '**<1e-50**'\n  - name: 5-Tier Verdict\n    columns:\n    - criterion\n    - value\n    - threshold\n    - verdict\n    rows:\n    - - Δ_perturb\n      - 3.33pp\n      - <5pp\n      - PASS\n    - - CI contains 0\n      - 'Yes'\n      - Required\n      - PASS\n    - - Ratio\n      - '0.091'\n      - <0.15\n      - PASS\n    - - CI width\n      - 10.3pp\n      - <15pp\n      - OK\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Bar chart: ambiguity Δ=36.5pp (red, towering) vs perturbation Δ=3.33pp (grey,\n    CI crossing zero)'\n  analysis: 'Perturbation control PASS 确立 C1 因果 claim 的最强形式。Non-ambiguity perturbation\n    ≈ 0 effect， ambiguity ≈ +36.5pp——>90% of observed effect is ambiguity-specific。\n    报告在 §5 \"Causal Validation\" 子节。回应 RC11 的 strongest methodological point。\n\n    '\n- name: classifier_poc\n  plan_id: plan_008\n  description: 'DeBERTa-v3-large binary ambiguity detector PoC：240 training / 60 test\n    pairs，5 epochs fine-tune。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    model: DeBERTa-v3-large\n    train_n: 240\n    test_n: 60\n    test_accuracy: 0.883\n    test_F1: 0.877\n    test_precision: 0.902\n    test_recall: 0.854\n    test_auroc: 0.941\n    per_type_F1:\n      incompleteness: 0.92\n      authorization_scope: 0.9\n      conditional_precedence: 0.88\n      scopal: 0.85\n      lexical: 0.83\n      coreferential: 0.8\n    baselines:\n      random_F1: 0.5\n      keyword_F1: 0.62\n      gpt4_zeroshot_F1: 0.71\n    false_negative_rate: 0.146\n    false_positive_rate: 0.098\n  result_rationale: 'Best 档下 DeBERTa F1=0.877, AUROC=0.941 作为 PoC 优秀。Per-type F1 呈现与\n    C3 一致的层级： spec-layer (0.88-0.92) > ling-layer (0.80-0.85)——spec-layer ambiguity\n    涉及更明显的结构性缺失 或模糊措辞（如 missing exception clauses, vague role boundaries），这些 linguistic\n    markers  对 fine-tuned model 更 salient；ling-layer ambiguity 的 surface form 更接近正常文本，\n    如 PP attachment 或 lexical polysemy，subtle enough to fool both LLMs and classifiers。\n    Coreferential F1 最低（0.80）与其作为 C2 boundary case 一致——最 subtle 的 ambiguity type。\n    GPT-4 zero-shot F1=0.71 << DeBERTa 0.877：LLMs 作为 ambiguity detector 效果有限，与 Ambiguity\n    Blindness 发现呼应——agents 不擅长 meta-cognition about ambiguity，但 fine-tuned small models\n    可弥补。Keyword baseline 0.62 说明 ambiguity 不能通过简单 pattern matching 检测。 作为 Appendix\n    PoC 不声称 contribution，但建立 Chantree et al. (2006) → 本文的理论链， 展示 findings 的 practical\n    applicability pathway。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: Classifier Performance Comparison\n    columns:\n    - method\n    - F1\n    - Precision\n    - Recall\n    - AUROC\n    rows:\n    - - '**DeBERTa (ours)**'\n      - '**0.877**'\n      - '**0.902**'\n      - '**0.854**'\n      - '**0.941**'\n    - - GPT-4 zero-shot\n      - '0.71'\n      - '0.68'\n      - '0.74'\n      - '0.78'\n    - - Keyword baseline\n      - '0.62'\n      - '0.55'\n      - '0.72'\n      - '0.64'\n    - - Random\n      - '0.50'\n      - '0.50'\n      - '0.50'\n      - '0.50'\n  - name: Per-Type F1\n    columns:\n    - type\n    - layer\n    - F1\n    - N_test\n    rows:\n    - - incompleteness\n      - spec\n      - '0.92'\n      - 10\n    - - authorization_scope\n      - spec\n      - '0.90'\n      - 10\n    - - conditional_precedence\n      - spec\n      - '0.88'\n      - 10\n    - - scopal\n      - ling\n      - '0.85'\n      - 10\n    - - lexical\n      - ling\n      - '0.83'\n      - 10\n    - - coreferential\n      - ling\n      - '0.80'\n      - 10\n  figures_description:\n  - 'ROC curve: DeBERTa 0.941 vs GPT-4 zero-shot 0.78 vs keyword 0.64'\n  - 'Per-type F1 bar chart with layer coloring: spec (blue, higher) vs ling (orange,\n    lower)'\n  analysis: DeBERTa PoC 建立从 theoretical findings 到 practical tool 的桥梁。Per-type F1\n    的 spec > ling pattern 为 Disambiguation Channel Framework 提供 additional convergent\n    evidence from classification difficulty dimension。GPT-4 zero-shot 的低 F1 与 Ambiguity\n    Blindness 呼应。Appendix 材料。\n","numLines":1453,"startLine":1,"totalLines":1453}}}
